<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JDG" style="id">Vaihawmte</book>
  <para style="h">Vaihawmte</para>
  <para style="toc1">Vaihawmte</para>
  <para style="toc2">Vaihawmte</para>
  <para style="mt">Vaihawmte</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n, Joshua shi nuain hichi ahing hia, Israel taten “Kanaanmite dou a, kou a dinga vadou dingin koi ahiei va kuontou masa ding?” chi’n Mangpa a dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n “Juda kuontou heh: Ngai un akhut ah gam ka peta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Juda in asanggampa Simeon kungah, “Kanaanmite dou dingin ka goutan a hing kipie gam ah hing zuitou in, tualeh kei zong khum bangma in na goutan a hing kipie gam tandong ka hing zuina ding hi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Simeon in azuitou ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n, Juda akuontou a, Mangpa’n Kanaanmite leh Periz mite akhut uah apeta a, tualeh Bezek ah mi tulsawm athatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh amaun Bezek khuo ah Adoni-Bezek amu ua, adou ua, Kanaanmite leh Perez mite athat ua, azou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Adoni-Bezek atai a, amaun anuadel ua, aman ua, akhutpi tegel leh akengpi tegel atansan pieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Adoni-Bezek in “Leng sawm sagi ka dawkan nuoi a ann neng kie tawm zelte, akhutpi u’leh akengpite uh kana tansan pieh bang banga Pasian in kei tunga ahing thuh ahita,” achi hi. Tualeh ama khu Jerusalem ah apui ua, khunah ashita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Juda taten Jerusalem adou ua, ala ua, tualeh namsau hiem in asatlia ua, akhopi meiin ahal uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh khumzou in Juda tate Kanaanmite singtang gam a umte, simlam gam a umte leh phaijang gam a umte dou dingin akuon suh ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Juda in Hebron khuo (Hebron khu masang lai in Kiriath-Arba aki chi hi) a teng Kanaanmite ava dou a. Tualeh amaun Sheshai, Ahiman leh Talmai athat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khuna kipat in Debir khuo a tengte ava dou ua, (masanglai in Debir khuo khu Kiriath-Sepher akichi hi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Kaleb in “Koipou Kiriath-Sepher vadou a, valazou aumleh ka tanu Aksa azi dingin ka pe ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Kaleb naupa Kenaz tapa Othnielin ala a, tuachi’n Kaleb in zong atanu Aksa khu Othniel zi dingin apeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi a, amanu akunga ahing tun tahin Othniel in apa kunga gam ngen dingin asawl a, tualeh amanu asabiltung tunga kipata ahing kumsuh in Kaleb in amanu kungah, “Bang deina hiei?” chi’n ana dong a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu’n akungah, “Hing guolzawl inlen, sim lamgam na hing pieh ngal leh, tuinah neite zong hing pie’n” achi a. Tuachi’n Kaleb in amanu kungah tui nahnei sahta zaw leh tuinah nei hangta pen apeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi sungpa kenmi hahlesuonte khu tum sing khopi apat in Arad simlam a um Juda gamdai ah Juda tate toh apeitou ua, tuachi’n agam mite lah ah ava tengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Juda khu asanggampa Simeon toh akuon ua, Zephath khuo ateng Kanaanmite avasim ua, a thatgam sieng ua, asuchimit uhi, tuachi’n khum khopi khu Hormah akichita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Juda miten Gaza khopi leh agam, Ashkelon khopi leh agam tualeh Ekron khopi leh agam ala uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh, Mangpa’n Juda mite a umpi a, tuachi’n amaun singtang gam a tengte adeldoh sienga, hinanleh sia kangtalai anei ziehun phaijanga tengte pen adeldoh zousih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Mosi in ana gensama bangin Hebron khuo pen Kaleb kungah apie uhi: tuachi’n aman Anak tapa thumte khuna pat in adeldoh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Benjamin hahlesuonten Jerusalem a teng Jebusmite adeldoh sih ua, tuachi’n tuni dongin Jebusmite khu Jerusalem ah Benjamin hahle suonte toh ateng khawm ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuin, Joseph innkuonte zong Bethel dou dingin akuontou ua, tualeh Mangpa’n amauh a umpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khumin, Joseph innkuonten Bethel khuo endap dingin mi asawl uhi. (Masanglai in tua khomin khu Luz ahi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh endap miten mi khat khosung akipata hing pawtdoh amu ua, akungah, “Hepitahin khopi sung lutna hing hilin, tuachi’n kouzong na tungah khotuona ka hing musah ding uhi,” achi ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n amapa’n khopi sung lutna a ensah a, tuachi’n amaun namsau hiemin khum khopi asatgam sieng ua, hinanleh tua mipa leh a innkuonte zousie apei sah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh khum mipa khu Hitmite gam sungah alut a, khopi abawla, tua khopi min dingin Luz achi a, tuni dongin khum kho min apo nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Manasseh in zong Beth-Shean leh akhoneu a tengte, Taanak leh akhoneu a tengte, Dor leh akhoneu a tengte, Ibleam leh akhoneu a tengte, tualeh Megiddo leh akhoneu a tengte, adeldoh sih a, tuaziehin Kanaanmite khum gam ah ateng den zawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi a, Israelte ahing hattah un, Kanaanmite sie lieuin akoi ua, hinanleh adeldoh sieng sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ephraim in zong Gezer a teng Kanaanmite adeldoh sih a tuachi’n Kanaanmite Gezer khuo ah alah uah atengzawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zebulun in zong Kitron a tengte leh Nahalol a tengte adeldoh sih ua, hinanleh alah uah sie lieu in ateng den sahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Asher in zong Akko khuo a tengte, Sidon khuo a tengte, Ahlab khuo a tengte, Akzib khuo atengte Helba khuo a tengte, Aphik khuo a tengte, Rehob khuo a tengte adeldoh sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n Asher mite khu khum gam a teng Kanaanmite lah ah ateng zawta uhi, aziehpen amauh adeldoh sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Naphtali in zong Beth-Shemesh a tengte leh Beth-Anath a tengte adeldoh sih a, Kanaanmite leh khum gam a tengte lah ah ateng zawta uhi; hinanleh Beth-Shemesh a tengte leh Beth-Anath a tengte sie-alieu sah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tualeh Amor miten Dan tate khu singtang gam ah anot tou ua, phaijanga ahing peisuh ding uh aphal sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Amor mite pen Heres muol leh Aijalon khuo leh Shaalbim khuo te ah ateng den ua, hinanleh ama uh akhut nuoi ua nasem a pangsah dingin Joseph innkuonte khut ahat zawsem nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh Amor mite gamgi khu Akrabbim kaltouna akipat in Sela leh atung lam dongin ahita bou hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Gilgal a kipat in Mangpa van sawltah khat Bokim khuo ah apeitou a, tualeh akung uah “Izipt akipat in ka hing puidoh a, napu leh pate uh kunga ka kichiemna gam ah ka hing puilutta a, nou toh ka thuhun ka bawtse sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh tam gam a teng te toh thuhun bawl sih unlen, amaitamte uh na suhchip pieh dinguh ahi, ka chi a, hinanleh ka thupiehte na zuisih uhi; bang dinga tami na bawl uh ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin na masang ua kipat a mau’te ka hing deldoh pieh nawn sih dinga, na pangthep ua ding in ling ahi zawta ding ua, tualeh a pasiente u’zong nou a dingin thang ahi ding uh zong kachi nalai hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi a, Mangpa vansawltah in Israel tate zousie kunga agen lai in, mipiten a aw uh asuo ua akapta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n khum mun min Bokim achita uhi, tualeh khum mun ah Mangpa kungah akithoita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Joshua in mipite akikhenzahsah nua in, Israel tate zousie amauh goutan gam chiet zuon dingin apeita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joshua dam sung leh, Joshua sanga dam sawt zaw upate dam sung leh Mangpa’n Israelte a dinga sil thupi tahtah abawl zousie mu zel mite dam sungin mipiten Mangpa nna asem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa suohpa Nun tapa Joshua kumza leh kumsawm a upa ahiin ashita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Gaash taang mallam panga, Ephraim singtaang gam a ama goutan gamgi sunga Timnath Heres mun ah Israel taten avuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh khum khanga mizousie khu apulepate uh kungah puikhawmin a um siengta uhi, tualeh ama ute nuain, Mangpa theilou, Israel tate dinga abawl pieh silte thei mawngmawng lou khangtha dang khat ahing umdohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel taten Mangpa mit muin sil gilou abawlta ua, Baalte nna asemta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa apu leh pate uh Pasian Izipt gam a kipata puidohpa alengatsan ua, pasien dang akim avel ua, mite pasiente azui ua, tualeh amasang uah akun ua, tuachi’n Mangpa alungthah sahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa alengatsan ua, Baal leh Ashtoreth te nna asem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa Israelte tungah a lungthahta a, tuachi’n amauh dou mite khut ah apekheta hi. Amelma uh akim avel ua umte khut ah akhawngta a, tuachi’n a galte uh a zou nawnta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Gal dou dinga akuon khietna lam pou uah Mangpa khut a tung uah aselam ngenin atunga, Mangpa’n akung ua kichiem a anagen bangin, buoi chitahin abuoita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n alah uah vaihawm mi ding atun ding pieh a, tuaten amauh va doute khut apat ahunkhe zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khuchi pipi in zong a vaihawm mite uh thu a zuisih ua, pasien dangte lah ah akizua ua, abie uhi. Apu leh pate un Mangpa thupiehte pom a azui leng uh lampite apielsan pai zuai ua, azuita sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n amaute dinga vaihawm mite abawl pieh bep in, Mangpa’n vaihawm mite a umpi a, vaihawm mite damsungin a melmate uh khut akipat in ahundoh zel hi, amauh nuoisie mite leh bawlgenthei mite zieha amaunate uh ziehin Mangpa’n ahepi a, akisiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hia, vaihawm mi ashi chiengin anuatol kia ua, pasien dangte nna asem ua, bie in amai ah akun ua, apu leh pate uh sangin ase zawin agamta uhi. Tualeh asil bawlte u’leh a lungtang ua apaupen nate uh zong akhetuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israelte tungah Mangpa athangpai mama ta a, tualeh “Tam namten apu leh pate uh kunga ka thuhun apalsie ua, ka thu azuita sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaziehin ken zong tuban sie, Joshua in ashi a anuasie namte amasang ua kipat ka deldoh pieh nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh apulepate zui banga Mangpa dan azui u’leh azuilou uh ze etna dingin amaute ka mangta ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa’n khum namte thakhat a deldoh pailouin anuasieta a, tualeh Joshua khut ah zong ape diehta sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam namte ahi, Mangpa’n Kanaan gam a gal kidouna thei nailou Israel mite ze etna dinga aumdensahte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tami Israel hahlesuonte tumasanga bangma thei nai vawtlouten ahing theina ding u’leh gal doudan amauh zilsah na ding maimai a a umsah ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tam namte khu Philistin Leeng ngate, Kanaanmite zousie, Sidonmite, Baal-Hermon taanga kipat a Hamath lutna tandonga Lebanon taanga teng Hiv mite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mangpa’n Mosi khut a apu leh pate uh kunga anapieh, Mangpa thupiehte azui u’leh zuilou uh theina dinga, Israel tate ze etna dinga kinuasie namte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel tate khu Kanaanmite, Hitmite, Amormite, Perizmite, Hivmite tualeh Jebus mite lah ah ateng ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh atanute uh ziin anei ua, tualeh amauh tanute a tapate uh zi dingin apie ua, apasiente uh nna asem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel taten Mangpa mitmu in silgilou abawlta ua, Mangpa a Pasian uh amanghil ua, Baalte leh Ashtorethte nna asemta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa khu Israelte tungah athangpaita a, tuachi’n amaute Mesopotamia leengpa Kushan-Rishathaim kungah a zuata hi. Tuachi’n Israel taten kum giet sung Kushan-Rishathaim nna asemta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Israel taten Mangpa ahat tah un, Mangpa’n Israel tate kungah amauh hundoh ding mi apie a, ama khu Kaleb naupa Kenaz tapa Othniel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa hagau atungah ahing tunga, Israelte tungah vai ahawm a, tuachi’n galdou dingin akuonkhie a, Mangpa’n Mesopotamia leengpa Kushan-Rishathaim akhut ah apekhie a, Kushan-Rishathaim azouta, akhut nuoi ah akoita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n gam khu kum sawmli sung galmuongin a umta hi. Tualeh Kenaz tapa Othniel ashita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Israel taten Mangpa mitmu in sil gilou abawl kiata ua, tuachia Mangpa mitmu a sil ana bawl kheltah zieh un, Mangpa’n Moab leengpa Eglon Israelte sangin ahatsah zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman Ammon mite leh Amalek mite akaikhawm a, tualeh akuon ua, Israelte ava dou ua, tumsing khopi ala ua, aluota uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel tate Moab leengpa Eglon thu nuoi ah kum sawm leh kum giet a um ua, anna asemta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh Israel taten Mangpa ahat kiatah un Mangpa’n Gera tapa Ehud, Benjamin nam a, miveilawng, amaute hundoh ding in aguot pieh hi. Tualeh Israel taten Moab leengpa Eglon kunga Sie pe dingin Ehud asawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ehud in namsau alangni a hiem tongtan a sau khat akhenga, tuakhu apheipi zietlam puon nuoi ah avomdap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aman sie lieu ding khu Moab leengpa Eglon kungah atawi a, tualeh Eglon khu mi thau mama khat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh sie apieh zou tahin, tua sie pomite asawlmanga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanleh ama pen Gilgal khuo kunga suong milim khenna mun a pat in akinuale kia a, akungah “Leengpa na kunga hing hil ding thuguh ka nei hi,” achi a, tuachi’n Lengpan, “Sip khin khian un” achi a, tuachi’n akunga um zousie’n apawtdohsanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Ehud akungah ava pei a, Eglon leengpa pen ni pi lai chienga khawldamna dinga kibawl inntung lam a apindan ah ana tou a. Tualeh Ehud in na kungah “Pasian thu vaihah gen ding ka nei hi” achi a, tualeh ama atouna akipat ahing dingdoh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ehud in akhut veilam in apheipi zietlam a namsau asatdoh a, agilpi ah asunlutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Atembul nangawn atumsuh a, tualeh athau in atem ma ahubit a, Ehud in agil akipat namsau adohkhe sih a, tuachi’n agilchimkha tui apawtta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ehud pen innhim langah apawta, inntung pindan kotte akhakhum a, apulam ah akilkhum bihbeh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khuchia apawtdoh zou tahin, Eglon suohte ahing pei ua, a et u’leh, inntung pindan kot ki kilte amu ua lamdang asa ua; “Anipi pindan a va tuom umtadi hiva” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachia lung nopmawtah a angah ngah vang un pindan kotkhate ang hong tuom mawngmawng tasih a, tuachi’n sawhonna ala ua, ahongta uhi. Tualeh, khumnah aleengpa uh tuong lai ah a shi sain ana lumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanleh, khuchia akiheh a azekai lah kal un Ehud ana taimangta a, suong milim khenna ana heng man a, Seirah ah atailut a a asuohta ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi a, khum mun atun in Ephraim muolte ah pengkul amut a, tualeh Israel tate khu khum muol a kipat in akumsuh ua, aman amauh alamkaita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh aman akung uah, “Hing zuiun, Mangpa’n na melma uh Moab mite na khut uah ahing pekheta hi,” achi a. Tuachi’n amaun anua azuisuh ua, Moab gam a Jordan lui galkaina mun tandong ala ua, koima agal kai ding aphal sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khumi tungin Moab mite mihat leh hangsan ngen tul sawm athat ua, mi khat zong a suohta a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n khum ni in Moab mite khu Israelte khut nuoi ah akipelutta uhi. Tuachi’n kum sawm giet sung gam galmuongin aumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh ama nua in Anath tapa Shamgar ahi a, aman bawng sutna chieng zum in Philistinte za guh athat a, aman zong Israelte ahun khie hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Ehud a shi nuain, Israel taten Mangpa mitmu in sil abawl khiel kiata ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n amaute Hazor a vaihawm Kanaan gam leengpa Jabin khut ah a zuata a, ama galkap lamkaipa khu Sisera ahia, Haroseth-Hagoiim khuo a teng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Israel taten Mangpa ahan ua, azieh khu ama’n sia kangtalai zakuo tah anei hi; tualeh kum sawmni sung vingveng Israel tate nasatah a nuoisie in asugenthei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khum hunlai in guolneinu Deborah Lappidoth zi in Israelte vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh amanu Ephraim singtang gam a Ramah leh Bethel kikaal a tum sing nuoi ah atou zel a. Tuachi’n Israeltate amanu kungah vaihawmpieh dingin a hawtou zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu’n Kedesh Naphtali gam a kipat in Abinoam tapa Barak athuhah a, akungah, “Mangpa Israelte Pasian in Naphtali tate leh Jebulun tate mi tul sawm la khawm inlen, Tabor muol ah pui tou in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Kishion lui ah Jabin galkap lamkai Sisera leh a kangtalai leh agalkap hon tampi toh kang sawl dinga, tualeh amauh na khut ah ka hing peding hi, chiin thu ahing pie asiei mah,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Barak in akungah, “Nang toh izawh ding leh ka kuon dinga, hinanleh nang zawpi sih ding leh kang kuon sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh amanu’n akungah, “Ka hing zawpi ding hi, ahivangin nava kuon na ah minpha na lawsih ding hi, aziehpen Mangpa’n Sisera khu numei khat khuta pelut ding ahi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Deborah adingdoh a Barak toh Kedesh langah akuonta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Barak in Naphtalite leh Jebulunte Kedesh ah ahankhawm a, tualeh ama mi tul sawm toh akuontou ua, tualeh Deborah zong amautoh akuontou ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh ken mi Heber, Mosi sungpa Hobab tate lah apat in atuom ten a, Kedesh kunga Zanaim a gangpi lienpi phungah apuon buh azah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Abinoam tapa Barak Tabor muol ah akuon touta chi Sisera ahil ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Sisera in zong a sakolleng, zousie, sia sakolleng zakuo leh Haroseth-Hagoiim a kipat kishon lui donga mipi zousie akhawm khawmta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Deborah in Barak kungah, “Khaile tuni Mangpa’n Sisera na khut sunga ahing pieh ni ahi, Mangpa na masangah apei asiei mah?” achi hi. Tuachi’n Barak Tabor muol a kipat akuonsuh a, tualeh mi tul sawm in ama azui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Sisera leh asakolleng zousie leh agalkap hon zousie Barak masangah namsau hiem in abuoithangsahta a, tuachi’n Sisera khu asakolleng tunga kipat akumkhie a, a kengin ataimangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh Barak in sakolleng leh galkapte khu Haroseth-Hagoiim tandong anuadel a, tualeh Sisera galkapte zousie namsau in athatgam sienga, khat zong ahing sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanlezong Sisera pen ken mi Heber zi Jael puoninn ah kengin atailut hi: aziehpen Hazor leengpa Jabin leh Ken mi Heber innkuonte kikaal ah kilemna ana um ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Jael khu Sisera kimupi dingin apawtdoh a, akungah “Pu aw hingkihei in, ka innsungah hing lut in, zausin,” achi a, tuachi’n puon inn sunga amanu kung a alut tahin, amanu’n puonkhou khat akhu khum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Sisera in akungah, “Hepitahin dawn ding tui themkhat hing pie’n ka dang atah mama hi” achi hi. Tuachi’n amanu’n bawngnawi bel ahonga, a dawn sah a, puon akhu khum kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh ama’n amanu kungah “Puon inn kot ah ding inlen, tualeh hichi ahi ding hi, mi koi ahiei ahing pei a, Tamnah mi a um khai chia ahing doh leh umlou na chi ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Heber zi Jael in puon inn themkhet khat ala a, akhut in seh khat atawi a, kaangnoukhat in azuon phei a, a ankhaibaw laitah ah akhen tumsuh a, tuol toh akilbehta hi, aziehpen alunggim thatawl toh a imut tui mama laitah ahi, tuachi’n ashita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Envawi, Barak in Sisera ahing nuadel a kimupi dingin Jael ahing pawtdoh a, akungah, “Hing pei in nami suipa ka hing ensah ding hi” achi a, tuachi’n amapa puon inn sunga avalut tahin, envawi Sisera shisa a lum ava mu a, a ankhaibaw ah themkhet ana kiphu vengvong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n khum ni in Pasian in Kanaan leengpa Jabin khu Israel tate masangah a guollel sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh Israel taten Kanaan leengpa asuh mangthai masangsie uh, ahat deudeu ua, Kanaan leengpa Jabin azouta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum ni in Deborah leh Abinoam tapa Barak in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israelte sunga lamkaiten ma apui lai un, Mipite a ma uh kiphalna toh akipumpieh lai un, Mangpa khu pah tawi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Aw, nou leengte ngaikhie unlen; Nou, leeng tapate aw, bildaw un; Keima, ahi keima ngelin, Mangpa Israel te Pasian phat na’n La kasa ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Mangpa Seir a kipat a navai kuondoh lai in, Edom gam a na peilai in, Simlei akilinga, vanten abokhie ua, Meilum ten zong tui abokhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Muol leh tangte Mangpa mai ah tui in aluongkhie ua, Israelte Mangpa masang ah, Sinai muol zong zil bangin aling hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Anath tapa Shamgar hunlai leh, Jael damlai nite in, Lamlienpite kikhul in, khuol zin mite lampelte ah apei uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Loubang tulta Israel gam vangkhuote, Israel gam tunnu Deborah kei ka thou doh a, Adingdohta Israel tunnu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amaun pasien thate atel ua, dougal pat bang asai uh, khopi kul dawngkotte ah, muding umlou, Lum leh phaw, Israel mi sang sawmli lah ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aum hi ka lungtang, Mipi dinga ki pum pieh, Israel vaihawmte lah ah, Mangpa phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Siem un, Nou sabiltung kaang tunga toute, Nou vaihawmna phawipi tunga toute leh, Nou lampi a peite in zong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thal kap mite husa mawngmawng, zah phahlouna tuikhuh te ah, Mangpa sildih bawlte agen ua, Israel galhangte dihna zong agen uhi, “Tuachi’n Mangpa mipite, khopi kulpi dawngkot ah apeisuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Thou in, thou in, Deborah, thou in, thou in, zaila sain dingdohin, Thou in Barak nang Abinoam tapa, Na galmatte suoh leh sal dingin pui in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n ahing pei uh mihat, um sunte leh mipite, Ahing kuonsuh ta uh ama adingin, Mipite Mangpa mihatte dou dingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Apei suh uh Amalek zungzamte Ephraim akipat in, Benjamin na mipiten ahing zuisuh uhi, Makir akipat in vaihawm mite ahing pei suh ua, Ahing pei suh uhi Zebulun akipat, Laigiel mi chieng tawi mite,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Issakar Leng tapate, Deborah toh apangkhawm uhi. Issakar bangin Barak zong, Atai suh hi phaijang ah, Thupieh amu dung zui in, Reuben namte kihawm khenna ah, lungtanga ngaituona thupi tahte a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bang dinga belam huong sung a touden nalai, Belamhon hatna theile tumging, ngai na hiei? Reuben namte lah ah, lungtang ki et chienna thupitah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Gilead mite Jordan gal ah akhawl den ua, Tualeh bangdinga Dan mite tembaw sunga umden ahi uoi? Asher mite tuipi pieu ah a umden ua, luipieu neute ah ateng denta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zebulun mite shina zauhuoi ah ading ua, Tuamabangin Naphtali zong munsang, Galphuolte ah a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Lengte hing peiin ahing dou ua, Tuachi’n Kanaan leengten Megiddo luigei ah, Tanak khuo ah akidoupi ua, Gal sillah khat zong alazou sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Van akipat adou a, Thangvan aasite’n alampi chiet ua kipat Sisera adou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kishion lui in atawmang hi amaute, Nidanglai Kishon lui tuisua in, Aw ka hinna hattah in pei zelin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Tuachi’n leithuong akihot hi, Sakol kengtaw gin in, Sakolte akitawm akitawm zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Meroz aw sie lawkhum un, Mangpa vansawltahin achi hi, Khumna tengte awsekhal toh samsie un, Amaute Mangpa panpi dingin ahing pei sih. Mihatte dou a Mangpa’n panpi dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Numei lah ah Jael, Ken mi Heber zi avanglien pen hi. Puon inn a teng numei lah ah avanglien ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amapa’n tui angen a, Bung nawi a pie hi; Milien nou in bawngnawi khal ahing tawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A khutin puon inn them khet ala a, Azietlam in nasem mi sehta atawi hi, Sisera lutang akhen a, Akhen pailetta hi; A ankhaibaw ah akhen lutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amanu kengbul ah khupbohin apua a, alum denta anu kengbul ah, a pua hi khupboh in akengbul ah, Ashi denta a puana mun ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“A hing dahhi Sisera nu kotta ah, Ahing han hi vathangkal hawm ah, Bangding a sakolleng hing tung ha ahiei? Bangzieha sakolleng gingte zekai ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Anumei pilten amanu ana dawng ua, Ahi ama leh ama kidawng hibou.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amu zouta sih uh amah? Akihawmta sih amah galvanlahte? Michin in nungah khat le ni chiet, Sisera tan ding pen, gallah puon zem tuom tuom, gallah puon zem kilawm, khut a kiphan zemtuom tuom leh, alang ni a zem kilawm ngawnga awding, chiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Tuabangin aw Mangpa, Mangthang sieng uheh na melmate zousie, Hinanleh Ama it leh ngaite pen, Hattaha pei ni bang hi uhen, chi in la asa uhi.” Tuachi’n gam khu kum sawmli sung galmuongin a umta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Israel taten Mangpa mitmu in Silgilou ana bawlta ua, tuachi’n Mangpa’n amaute kum sagi sung Midiante khut ah apedohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Midianten Israelte a zouta ua; Midiante ziehin Israelten muolte ah, kokhuhte, leikohawmte leh kulte abawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahia, Israelten haichi achiin pou pou chiengun, Midiante, Amalek mite leh suolam mite ava kuontou ua ava simzel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh amaun panmun akhawkhum ua, Gaza khuo tandongin lei a haichi poute asuhsiet pieh ua, tuachi’n Israel gam ah neh ding mawngmawng a khawi pieh sih ua, belamte, bawngte leh sabiltungte akhawi pieh sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaute, aganhonte u’leh, apuon innte u’leh asangawngsau te utoh, khauphe simsenglou tawn bangin ahing kuontou ua; tuachi’n atun tunna gam uh asuse zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Midiante ziehin Israelte ahing zawngkhal mamata ua, tuachi’n Israel tate Mangpa kungah akikouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi a, Israel taten Midiante zieha Mangpa ahat tah un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mangpa’n Israel tate kungah guolnei khat ahing sawl a, tualeh aman akung uah, Israelte “Mangpa Pasian in tambangin agen hi, Izipt akipat in ka hing puidoh a, na saltanna mun ua kipat in ka hing lakhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Izipt mite khut akipat leh nou hing nuoisie zousiete khut akipat in ka hing hundoh a, na masang uah amaute ka delmanga, agam uh nou ka hing pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh na kung uah Kei Mangpa na Pasian uh ka hi; Na tenna gam ua Amormite pasiente zong giing sih un ka chi a, hinanleh ka thu nasang sih uhi, achi hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa vansawlsieng khat ahing pei a, Ophrah khuo a um Abiezermi Joash gangpi sing nuoiah atou a: tualeh atapa Gideon in Midian mite mu theilou dingin grep suhna khuh ah bu ana chil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa vansawlsieng akungah ahing kilah a, akungah, “Nang mihat hangsan Mangpa na kungah aum hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Gideon in akungah, “Ka Mangpa aw, Mangpa ka kung a um ahileh bangchidan a tam silte zousie ka tung ua hing tung thei adiei? ka pule pate un Mangpa’n Izipt gam akipat ahing puitou hilou amah? chia, asil lamdang mama bawlte ahing hil zousiete uh heilanga bangchi sieng ata diei? Tu’n vang Mangpa’n hing pampai sieng ahita a, Midiante khut ah ahing pedohta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa ama lamah akiheia akungah, “Tam na hatna toh pei inlen, Midiante khuta kipat in Israelte hundam in: ka hing sawl hilou amah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh aman akungah, “Aw Mangpa, bangchin ken Israelte kava hundam thei mawh diei? Ngai in, Manasseh phungte lah a genthei pen kahi ua, kei lah ka pa innkuonte lah a neupen ka hinalai a” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n akungah, “Na kungah ka um dinga, tuachi’n Midiante mi khat bangin bailam tahin na zou sieng ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman akungah, “Na deisahna tang kahi leh nangma mama in nahing houpi chi ka theina dingin chiemtena khat hing musahin achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na mai a lat ding silpieh kava lah a, na kunga ka hing tunkia masangsie, hepitah in, tam na kipat in na peidoh vawt sin achi hi,” tualeh aman “Nang peikia masangsie kana um zing ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Gideon inn sungah alut a, kelnou khat leh tangbuong tolsawlou ephah khat abawl a, asa pen law sungah akoi a, atui pen bel sungah akoi a; tuachi’n gangpi sing nuoiah akungah ahing tawi a ama apeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mangpa vansawlsieng in akungah, “Sa leh tanghou tolsawlou la inlen tam suongpi tungah koi inlen, tualeh atuipen sungbuo in achi a,” tualeh aman tuabangin abawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa vansawlsieng in akhut a um achiengkhut dawn in, sa leh tanghou tolsawlou khu akhoi a; tualeh, suong a kipat in mei ahing pawt a, sa leh tanghou tolsawlou khu akatumta hi. Tualeh Mangpa vansawlsieng khu amangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tu’n Gideon in ama khu Mangpa vansawlsieng ahi chi atheichienta hi. Tuachi’n Gideon in “Eh, Mangpa Pasian Aw! Tu’n vang Mangpa vansawlsieng kimaituo in ka muta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n akungah “Lungmuong tahin um inlen, zausin, shi sih vateh” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n Gideon in tua munah Mangpa a dingin maitam khat abawl a, Jehovah shalom achi hi. Tuni dong in tami Abiezer mite khuo Ophrah ah aum nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh khum zan main hichi ahing hi a, Mangpa’n akungah, “Na pa bawngtal tuoi anina kum sagi phapen la inlen, na pa bawl Baal maitam satsie inlen akunga um Ashera zong phua in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa na Pasian a dingin tami suongpi vum tungah zenei tahin maitam khat bawl inlen, tualeh bawngtal ni na khu la inlen, Ashera na phua ding khu singin zang inlen, halmang sillat lan in” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n Gideon in asuohte lah a mi sawm azawpi a, Mangpa’n akunga agen bangin abawlta hi; hichi ahi a, apa innkuonte leh akhomite a giin ziehin sunlaiin abawl ngam sih a, zanlai in abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh khopi mite zingmawng matah a ahing thaw tah un, Baal maitam satchip in ana um a; akunga Ashera zong satpua in ana um a, tualeh bawngtal ni na khu maitam kibawl tungah lat in ana umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Tami koi bawl ahiei?” chi’n khat leh khat akidong tuo kawi ua, tualeh akidawp ua, akan kawi kawi u’leh “Joash tapa Gideon bawl ana hita hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua khopi miten Joash kungah, “Na tapa hing la dohin, ashi teitei ding ahi, Baal maitam asat chip zieh leh akunga Ashera aphua ziehin” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh Joash in ama nielkalte zousie kungah, “Baal humding na hi uoi? Ama hundam ding nahi uoi? koipou ama hum pouma zingmawng chieng mama a tha ding ahi; Pasian tahtah ahileh amaitam kisuhsiet ziehin ama leh ama kihun leh avele,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuaziehin, khum niin ama khu Jerubaal achi ta hi, “Baal in amapa demta heh,” azieh pen amaitam asatchip piehta hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachi’n Midianmite zousie leh Amalek mite, tualeh suolam gam mipite ahing kikhawm khawm ua, Jordan agalkai ua, Jezreel phaijangah pan mun akhaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hinanleh Mangpa hagau Gideon tungah ahing tunga, tualeh aman pengkul a mut a, Abiezer mipite anua ah akikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh aman Manasseh gamsung pumpi ah thangkou mi asawl a, amaute zong anua ah ahing kikhawm ua, tualeh Asherte, Zebulunte leh Naphtali kungah thangkou asawl a, amauh kimupi dingin ahing peitou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tualeh Gideon in Pasian kungah. “Na gen banga kei khuta Israelte na hundam ding leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />En in, bu phuol ah belam mul lom khat ka koi dinga, tam belam mul tung maimai a daitui ana kieh a, akimvel leitangte ana gaw leh na gen bangin keima khut in Israelte na hundam ding chi ka thei ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tualeh tuabangin ana um ngut a, azingni zingmawng matah in athou a belam mul aheh leh belam mul a um daitui heng kuong dim khat ana um hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tualeh Gideon in Pasian kungah, “Ka tungah lungthah sinlen, khat vei maimai hing gen kiavang, ka hing ngen a hi, tam belam mul mama toh ka en khe kia ding hi; tuin belam mul ana hul henlen, akim avel a leitung tengah daitui nakie heh” achi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian in khumi zan in zong tuabangma in abawl hi, belam mul maimai ana hul a, akim vela lei tung tengah daitui ana um kia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jerubaal (tua khu Gideon ahi) leh akunga um mipi zousie zingmawng matahin athou ua, Harod tuikhuh gei ah akikul ua, tualeh Midiante pen amauh sahlam phaijang, Moreh muol pangah aum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Gideon kungah, “Midian mite akhut ua ka pieh na dingin, na kunga umte kei dingin atam seng uhi; tuachilouin vang Israelten eima khut ngei a, kihundam ihi uh chi’n aki uongsah kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin, tuin mipite zah ngeiin gen in, koipou zau leh linga umte, nua pei kia uheh,” Gilead muol akipat in nua peikia uheh, chi’n puong khie in achi a. Tuachi’n mipite tul sawmni leh tul ni anua pei kia ua; tualeh tul sawm a um nalai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Gideon kungah, “Mipite atam seng nalai uhi, lui ah zawpi suh inlen, tuanah keiman ka hing khen pieh ding hi, tualeh hichi ahi dinga, Na kunga tam mipa nang toh zawhkhawm heh ka chi pouma na zawpi dinga, tualeh tam mipa zawpi sin kachi pouma na zawpi lou ding ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipite lui ah apui suh a, tualeh Mangpa’n Gideon kungah, “Ui banga alei a tui lieh thaw pouma atuom in koikhe zel inlen, tuabang main koipou tui adawn chienga khupdin a chipthaw pouma zong atuom in um sah in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh akhutpeh uh akam ua koi a liehthawte mi zathum ahi ua, adang teng pen kun a khup din a chip thaw ngen ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Gideon kungah, “Mi zathum alieh a liehthawte zangin nou ka hing hundam dinga, Midiante na khut uah ka hing peding hi, tualeh mi dang zousie amauh mun chiet ah pei kiata uheh” achi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipiten akhut uah neh ding leh pengkul atawi ua, tualeh Israel mi zousie a puon inn lam chiet uah apeisah sienga, mi zathumte maimai aum sahta hi. Tualeh Midian galkapte panmun khu amaute umna hanglam phaijanga um ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh khum zanin, hichi ahing hi a, Mangpa’n akungah, “Thou inlen apanmun uh sim dingin kuon suh in, na khut ah ka hing peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh, kuonsuh ding na zau leh na suohpa Purah zawpi inlen agiehphuol ah vapei suh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh bang a gen uoi chi nava za dinga; tuazou chiengin na khut suhhatin a um dinga, agiehphuol uah nava kuon ngamta ding hi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n asuohpa Purah toh agiehphuol panmun ua galvenna tuoh masah pente umna dong apei suhta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Midiante leh Amalekte tualeh suolam mipite zousie, simsenglou khauphehon bang maiin phaijang ah a um ua, tualeh asangawngsaute uh tam dan pen tuipi pieu a senel simsenglou bangmai ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Gideon ahing tunsuh tahin, mi khat in alawmpa kungah amang ana gen a, akungah, “Ngaivawi mang ka nei a, tualeh barli bu tanghou khat Midiante giehphuol ah ahing kilia suh a puon buh sungah akilia lut a, puonbuh apuasah a, akikhule sah a, tuol ah akiphengpha sahta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh alawmpan adawnga akungah, “Tam pen Israel mi Joash tapa Gideon namsau loungal bangma dang ahisih hi, Pasian in Midiante leh agalkapte zousie akhut a apekhiet ahita maive” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh tambang ahing hi a, Gideon in tua mang kigen leh akhiehna akihilchien uh azahtah in Pasian abeta hi; tuachi’n Israelte gieh phuol ah anua peikia a, “Thou un Mangpa’n na khut uah Midian galkapte ahing pekheta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n mi zathumte khu pawl thum in akhen a, tuachi’n michin khut ah pengkul khat leh leibel hawm a sunga meisel koisa khat chiet a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh aman akung uah, “Hing en unlen kabawl bang bangin bawl zel un, tualeh, agiehphuol monguh ka tuntah chienga kabawl bang banga nang bawl zel dinguh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kei leh ka kunga um zousie tengin pengkul ka hing mutging tah chiengun, agiehphuol kimvel a um tengin pengkul nang mutging chiet ding uh ahi, Tualeh Mangpa leh Gideon a dingin, na chi chiet ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Gideon leh akunga um mi zakhat ten zan galven laita kihen hun laitahin giehphuol monga galveng dinna bul ahing tungsuh ua, tualeh pengkul amut ua, abel tawite uh atawkeh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh apawl thum un apengkul chiet uh amut ua, abelte uh a tawkeh ua, aveilam khut un meisel atawi ua, a khut zietlam un pengkul mut ding atawi uhi. Tualeh “Mangpa leh Gideon namsau chiin akikou uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh giehphuol kimvel ah michin amauh pan mun chiet ah ading ua, tuachi’n Midian galkapte zousie atai ua, ataizah kawm un akikou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachia mi zathumten apengkul chiet uh amut ging tah un, Mangpa’n Midian galkapte zousie ama u’leh amauh namsau in akisattuo sahta a, tuachi’n a galkapte uh guollel in Zeverah gam a Beth-Shitah langah leh Tabath kunga Abel-meholah gamgi tandong ataizahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh Israel tate, Naphtali, Asher leh Manasseh akipat akikhawm khawm ua, Midiante anuadelta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n Gideon in Ephraim singtang gam zousie ah thangkou asawl a, Midian mite dou dingin “Hing pei suh unlen, Beth-Barah leh Jordan luite tandongin” na kheltan un ava chisah hi. Tualeh Ephraim mite zousie a kikhawm ua, Beth-Barah leh Jordan luite tandongin ana khelta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Midiante leeng tapate ni Oreb leh Zeebte ahingin aman ua, Oreb khu Oreb suongpi tungah athat ua, Zeeb pen Zeeb greptui suhna ah athat uhi. Tualeh Midiante anuadel zel ua, tualeh Oreb leh Zeeb lutangte khu Jordan gallam a Gideon kungah ahing puo uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh tuin Ephraim miten akungah, “Bang zieha tambanga na hing bawl a, Midiante toh na kidouna a bang dinga koute na hing chiellou ahiei?” achi ua, hatangpi’n a phawh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman akung uah, “Noute toh tekahh dinga bang ahiei ka bawl khiel? Abiezerte grep law sangin Ephraimte grep sang khon athupi asiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pasian in Midiante leeng tapate Oreb leh Zeeb na khut uah ahing pekheta hi; tuachi’n noutoh tekahh dingin bang ka bawl thei tuom a ahiei?” achi hi. Tuachi’n tuabang thute agen bepin atunga alungthahna uh athengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Gideon leh akunga mi zathum umten Jordan lui apha suh ua, akaan ua, gim sasa in anuadel zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Sukoth khuo a mite kungah, “Tam kanua zuite hepitahin tanghou hing pieh pieh vawi un gilkiel in ahusam siengta uhi; Tualeh Midian leengte Zebah leh Zalmuna nuadel ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Sukoth khuo a a lamkaite un, “Zebah leh Zalmuna na khut sunga um ahita uoimah? Bangdinga na galkapte tanghou kapieh mawh ding uh ahiei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Gideon in, “Aw le tua ahileh, Mangpa’n Zebah leh Zalmuna ka khut sunga ahing pieh chiengin, gamdai ling leh louling neite in nasa tunguh ka kuikeh zengzung na ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n khuna kipat in Penuel ah apei touta ua, tuabang main ngetna abawl kia a, Penuel khuo a miten zong Sukoth khomite dawn bangma in ana dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman zong Penuel khomite kungah, “Lemna toh galzou a ka hing kinuale kia chiengin tam kulpi ka satchim ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuin Zebah leh Zalmuna pen, suolam mite galkap ashimawh umsun tul sawm leh ngate toh Karkor ah ana um uhi, galkap namsau dohthei ngen tul za leh tul sawmni ashi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Gideon khu Nobah leh Jogbehah suolam a puon inn a tengte lampi ah a kuontou a, galmuong tah a um galkapte ava bing phawn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Zebah leh Zalmuna ataimang bep un anuadel pai a, tuachi’n Midiante leeng nite gel Zebah leh Zalmuna ani un aman ua, tualeh agalkapte uh abuoithang sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joash tapa Gideon khu Heres kaltouna, kidounaphuol akipat in ahing kinuale kiata hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Sukoth khomi tangval khat aman a, thu adonga tualeh Sukoth khuo a miliente leh upate min agiel sah a, sawm sagi leh sagi ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Sukoth khuo a mite kungah ahawtou a, “Zebah leh Zalmuna tu’n en chiet di uo leh tamte ave ua leh Zebah leh Zalmuna na khuta umsa bang mai a, na galkap gilkiel husamte tanghou ka pieh kawi dinguh chia na hing enghou nate uh;” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n khum khopi upate aman a, gamdai ling leh loulingneite’n Sukoth mite a zep hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh aman penuel khopi kulpi asatchima, tualeh akhopi mite zong athat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Zebah leh Zalmuna kungah, “Tabor muol a, na mithate uh mibangchi bang ahi uoi?” achi hi. Tualeh amaun “Nang bang ngen ahi ua, leeng tapate toh kibahna anei chiet uhi,” chi’n adawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman, “Amaute ka unaute kanu tapate vawt ahi uhi, Mangpa ahin bangin, na hingkhawi hi ulachin, nou hing that louma ding hiveng maw,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh atapa upapen Jether kungah, “Kisa’nlen nang amauh va that in” achi a, hinanleh tangval pan anamsau adoh sih a, aziehpen khang dawng ahi nahlai ziehin azau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Zebah leh Zalmuna in, “Nangma hing kipan inlen hing that maive; piching leh piching ikibuon ding ahi,” achi ua. Tuachi’n Gideon ading doh a, Zebah leh Zalmuna athatta hi, tualeh a sangawngsaute uh ngawng a kizepma ngawngkuolte alata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel miten Gideon kungah, “Nang ka tung uah vaihawm inlen, na tate leh na tuten zong; nangman Midiante khut akipat na hing hundoh tah zieh in,” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanleh Gideon in akung uah, “Noute tung ah vai ka hawm sih ding, ka tapa in zong na tung uah vai ahawm sih dinga, Mangpa’n na tung uah vai ahawm zaw ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n Gideon in akung uah, “Nou apat in nget ut sil khat ka nei hi, michin in na galvanlah bilba uh hing pe chiet ve ua,” achi a. (Ishmael mite ahiziehun sana bilba anei uhi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n amauten “Kipahtahin ka hing peding uhi” chi’n adawng uhi; tuachi’n puon apha ua, michin in a gallah bilba uh ahing sep khawm chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua sana bilba angette gihdan shekel tul khat leh zasagi ahi a; tuate chilou Midian leengte satung a, kizepnate, ngawng awte, puon sandupte tuate ban ah a sangawngsaute uh ngawnga khainiengte bang ahi nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh Gideon in khum silte in Ephod khat abawla, tua khu atenna ophrah khopi ah a koi hi; tualeh Israel tate zousie’n Pasian a nuangat san ua, tuakhu bie in ang ana kawm siengta uhi; tuachi’n Gideon leh a innkuonpite nasan adingin zong thang ahing hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tambangin Midiante khu Israelte masangah ngiemsahin a um ua, tuachi’n, akipan kia zou nawn sih uhi. Tualeh Gideon damsungin gam kum sawmli sung galmuongin a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n Joash tapa Jerubal apeia, ama inn ah atengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Gideon in ama hindoh ngelngel tapa sawm sagi anei hi; zi tampi anei ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh Shekem khuo a um ameinu’n zong tapa khat ahinpieh nalai a, amin dingin Abimelek ahisah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh Joash tapa Gideon tehsetah ahiin ashi a, Abiezer mite gam a Ophrah kichi mun apa Joash kivuina han ah avuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi a, Gideon shi zoutahin, Israel tate akilehei ua Baal bie in ang akawm ua, tuachi’n Baal-Berith khu pasien in aneita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tualeh Israel taten, akim avel ua amelmate uh lah a kipata hunkhepa Mangpa a Pasian uh athei kha nawnta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh Jerubaal (Gideon china) in Israelte dinga silhoi abawl zousie dungzuiin, amauten Gideon innkuonpite kungah hepina alangsah nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin Jerubal tapa Abimelek khu anu sanggamte tenna Shekem khuo ah ava pei a, amau’leh anu pa inn sungmite zousie toh ava kithukum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Hepitahin Shekem khuo a mizousie zah dingin thugen unlen; Jerubaal tapa sawm sagiten na tung ua vai ahawm uh na dei uoi? ahisihleh mi khat in ahawm na deizaw uoi? chiin adongta a. Kei na tahsa u’leh na gu nataang uh ka hi chi theizing un;” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh anu sanggamten, Shekem khuo a mi zousie zahin ama tungtang thu agen ua, tualeh alungtangte uh Abimelek zui dingin a awn siengta hi. Tualeh amaun “Ama pen isanggampa uh ahi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Baal-Berith inn sunga kipat in amapa dangka Shekel sawm sagi apie ua, tuami toh Abimelek in mi thulimlou leh mi ginalou pipite aguoi a, tualeh amaun amapa nua azuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama khu Ophrah khuo a apa innkuonte kung ah apeita hi; tualeh asanggamte Jerubaal tapa sawmsagite abawn un suongpi tungkhat ah abantha siengta hi. Hinanleh Jerubaal tapa tum pen Jotham ana kiphuol khah ziehin dam in asuohta kha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Shekem khuo a mipite zousie leh Beth-millo a mipite zousie akikhawm khawm ua, tuachi’n Abimelek Shekem khuo a suongphu kunga gangpi bul ah leeng in abawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh tamthu Jotham ahil tahun, apeitou a, Gerizim muolvum ah ava dinga, tualeh aw ngaitahin akikou a, akung uah, “Nou Shekem khuo a mite aw ka thugen na ngaikhie un, Pasian in nou a hing ngai khieh theina ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Singte khu khatvei atung ua leengpa ding sathau nu dingin akuonkhie ua, Olive sing kungah, ka tung uah nang vaihawmin achi ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh Olive singin akung uah, Pasian leh mihingte zatat a aumna ka thau piehlai tawpsanin singte tungah lelam lelam ah ka kiloh kawi ding amah? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n singten theipi sing kungah, Nang hing pei inlen ka tung uah, vai hing hawm maiin achi ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />hinanleh, theipi singin akung uah, ka humna leh ka ga hoite tawpsan in singte tungah lelam lelam ah ka kiloh koi ding amah? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n singten grepgui kungah, Nang hing pei inlen ka tung uah vai hing hawm mai in, achi ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh grep guiin akung uah, Pasian leh mihing kipahsah zing ka uoin thate tawpsan in singte tungah, lelam lelam ah ka kiloh kawi mawngmawng ding amah? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n sing zousie’n theimiling kungah, Nang hing pei inlen ka tung uah vaihawmin hing pang mai in achi ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh theimilingin singte kungah, Na leengpa ding ua sathau hing nu sawm tahpi nahi u’leh ka him nuoi hing bel un, hinanleh na chi tahpi uh ahisihleh, theimi ling a pat mei hing pawt henlen Lebanon muol a Sidar sing zousie katum sieng heh achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tuaziehin, tuin dihtah leh ginum tah a Abimelek na leengpa ding ua bawl na hi ua, tualeh Jerubaal leh a innkuonpite tunga hoitah a gamta a, anasep dantoh kituoh dungzui a bawl nahi u’leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka pa’n na galte uh ahing dou pieh a, ahinna taan khop in Midiante khut akipat in noute ahing hunkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh tuni’n ka pa innkuonte tungah na hel ua, atapate sawmsagi tah suongpi khat tungah na that ua, na sanggampa uh ahiziehin suohnu tapa Abimelek Shekem mite tunga na leengpa dingun na bawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachia tunia Jerubaal leh a innkuonpite tunga thutah leh ginumtah a na gamta na hi nahpou u’leh, Abimelek tungah kipah un, tualeh Abimelek zong na tung uah kipah heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh tuabang ahisihleh Abimelek akipat meikuong hing pawtdoh henlen, Shekem leh Beth-Millo khuo a mite zousie katum sieng henlen, tualeh Shekem mite akipat leh Beth-Millo mite akipat in mei hing pawtdoh henlen Abimelek zong katumta heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Jotham atai a, Beer langah ataimanga, asanggampa Abimelek agiin ziehin khunah ateng denta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n Abimelek in Israelte tungah kum thum vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pasian in Abimelek leh Shekem mite kikaal ah lungsim gilou apieng sah a, tuachi’n Shekem khuo a mite Abimelek tungah lepchie tahin a zuoutat ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuakhu Jerubaal tapa sawm sagite tunga chizat huoi tah a atatsiet zieh ua, atung ua phubalahna ahing tun theina ding leh amauh thatpa asanggampa uh Abimelek tung leh asanggamte that dinga ana kithuopi Shekem mite tunga asisan maw uh aum theina ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Shekem khuo a miten muolvumte ah ama buhdap a lamtaan dingin mite akoi ua, khuna pei poumate ana suom zel uhi; tuachi’n tua thute Abimelek ahil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh Ebed tapa Gaal khu a unaute toh ahing kuon ua, Shekem khuo ah alut ua, Shekem mite zousie in ama amuong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n lou langah ava pei ua, a grep gate uh alou ua, achil ua, ane un adawn ua, a pasien innte uah alut ua, guolnop abawl ua, Abimelek awsie alawkhum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ebed tapa Gaal in, “Abimelek nachi uh koi ahiei? Shekem kichi zong koi ahiei? eiten anna isep pieh phuat ding? Jerubaal tapa hibou lou ahiei mah? Zebul houtupa hilou ahiei mah? Shekem pa Hamor lawite nna semlei asih diei? bang ziehin ama nna isem ding uoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tam mipite ka khut nuoi ah umta mai u’leh aw! tuachi’n Abimelek pen ladoh mai ding hi vengin, achi hi. Tuachi’n aman Abimelek kungah na galkapte khawm inlen kidou dingin hing kuon in” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khum khopi a vaihawmpa Zebul in, Ebed tapa Gaal thu gen azahin, alungthahna thakhat in ahing souta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tualeh pilkheltahin Abimelek kungah thangkou mi adap sawl a; “Ngaiin, Ebed tapa Gaal leh a unaute Shekem ah ahing kuon ua, tualeh ngaiin nangma dou dingin khopi mite ahantawh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin, azan azan in hing kisa unlen nang leh na kunga na umpite hing kuon unlen gam lah ah nabuh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahi dinga, zingmawng ni suoh pat tahin na kipan pai inlen khopi sung hing sim in; tualeh ngaiin ama leh amipi akunga umte nang doudinga ahing kuondoh chiengun hoinasah bang bangin atung uah na nabawl mai ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuachi’n Abimelek leh amipi zousie azan azan in athou ua, pawl li-in akikhen ua, Shekem khuo a imta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh Ebed tapa Gaal ava pawtdoh a, khopi lutna kulkotpi phungah ava dinga, tuatahin Abimelek leh agalkapte aki butna ua kipat ahing kuondoh ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Gaal in amutahin Zebul kungah “En un, muolvum akipat in mipite ahing peisuh uhi,” achi hi. Hinanleh Zebul in akungah “muol himte khu mihing banga namu khat hiva” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuachi’n Gaal in, “Envawi, gamlaizang ah mipi ahing peisuh uhi, pawl dang khatte phunsante gangpi sing lang manawin ahing pei uhi” achi kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuachi’n Zebul in akungah, Abimelek koi ahia ana isep pieh ding uh? chia na genna “Nakam hei a umta ahiei? Tamte hilou amah na mi simmawte? Tun kuon inlen vadou ngut ve,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuachi’n Gaal in Shekem mite alamkai a, Abimelek toh ava kidouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tualeh Abimelek in ama anadel a, ama ana taimanga, ataina lam uah khopi lutna kulpi kotphung dongin mi tampi liem le bai in apua zengzung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tuachi’n Abimelek khu Arumah khuo ah atengta a, tualeh Zebul in Gaal leh a unaute Shekem a teng theilou dingin adeldoh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hia, azing ni’n mipite lou langah apei ua, Abimelek ahil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuachi’n amipite azawpi a, pawlthum in akhen a tualeh gamlah ah ana buh uhi. Tualeh a en a, mipite khopi akipat a hing pawtdoh uh amutahin, adingdoh a ana dou ua athatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tualeh Abimelek leh alawiten mailam nawt in adel zel ua, khopi lutna kulpi kotphungah ava ding ua, tualeh pawldang nite’n gamlah a umte abawin abawthaw ua, athatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Khum ni’n Abimelek in khopi khu sun nitumin adou a, khopi ala a, asunga um mi zousie athatgam a, tualeh khopi asusie dimdem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuachi’n Shekem kulpi a um mi zousie’n tua thu azah tah un, El-Berith pasien biehinn dettah sung ah alutta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tualeh Shekem kulpi a um mi zousie akikhawm khawmta uh chi’n Abimelek ahil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tualeh Abimelek leh akunga um zousie Zalmon muol ah akaltou ua, Abimelek in heipi khat akeng a, singba khat asatkhie a, aliengkou ah apuo-a, tualeh akunga um mite kungah, “Ka bawl dan namu uhi, ka bawl bang bangin nouten zong kintah in bawl un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tuachi’n mi zousien khumbangmain singba asatkhe chiet ua, Abimelek azui ua, kulpi dettah ah asepkhawm ua, tualeh kulpi khu mei in ahal khumta ua, tuachi’n Shekem kulpi a um mi zousie ashi siengta uhi, pasal leh numei tul khat vel ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tuazouin Abimelek Thebez khuo ah ava pei a, Thebez a im khum ua, alata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Hinanleh khum khopi sungah, kulpi innsang dettah khat a um a, tualeh khum kulpi sungah mi zousie anu apa atailut ua, akikhakhumta uhi, tualeh khum kulpi innsang sungah a umkhawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tuachi’n Abimelek kulpi langah apei a, akidoupi a tualeh mei a haltum sawm in kulpi kotkhah lam zuon in apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Hinanleh numei khat in bu hehna suong atunglam khat Abimelek lutung zawn ah akhiehkhum a, tuachi’n alugu akehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tuatahin agalvan tawipa tangval khat a hanpai a, akungah, “Na namsau doh inlen hing that in, miten numei in athatta achilouna dingin” achi hi. Tuachi’n tangvalpa’n a asun pailet a, ashita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israelten Abimelek ashita chi amu bep un, michin a inn lang chiet uh zuon in apeita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Abimelek in asanggamte sawm sagi atha a apa tunga atatsietnate ziehin Pasian in tambangin athuhta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tualeh Shekem khomite tatsietna zousie khu Pasian in amauh lutung chiet mama ah athuh ta hi; tualeh Jerubaal tapa Jotham samsietna awsie khu ama uh tung ah atungta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abimelek shinua in Israelte hunkhe dingin Issakar nam a mi Dodo tapa, Puah tapa Tola, ahing kipandoh a, tualeh amapen Ephraim singtang gam a Shamir kichi khuo ah ateng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh aman Israelte tungah kum sawmni leh kum thum vai ahawma, tuachi’n ashi a, Shamir khuo ah avuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh ama nua in Gilead mi Jair ahing kipan doh a, tuachi’n Israelte tungah kum sawmni leh kumni vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman tapa sawmthum, sabiltungnou tunga tuong zel anei a, tualeh amauten khopi sawm thum anei ua, tuate tuni dongin Havoth-Jair akichi hi, tuate Gilead gam sunga um ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jair ashita a, Kamon khuo ah avui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel taten Mangpa mitmu in silgilou abawl kiata ua, tualeh Baalte, Ashtorethte, Siriate pasiente, Sidonte pasiente, Moabte pasiente, Ammon mite pasiente, leh Philistinte pasiente nna asemta ua, tuachi’n Mangpa aleengatsan ua, a nna zong asep pieh ta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israelte tungah Mangpa lungthahna akuongdohta a, tuachi’n Aman Philistinte leh Ammon mite khut ah azuata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh khumi kum apat in, Israel tate asubuoi ua, anuoisie ua, asugenthei mama uhi. Jordan gal a Gilead gam a Amorte gamsunga Israel tate zousie kum sawm leh kum giet sung nuoisie in abawlgenthei mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuathamlouin Ammon mite zong Judate, Benjaminte leh Ephraim innkuonte dou dingin Jordan agalkai ua, tuachi’n Israel tate buoi chitahin abuoiseta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel taten I Pasian uh ina leengatsanta ngut ua, Baalte nna iseppieh ziehun “Atungah ina bawlkhielta uhi; chiin Mangpa kunga kikou in ahanta uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Israeltate kungah, “Izipt mite leh Amormite lah a kipat, tualeh Ammon mite leh Philistin mipite lah akipat in noute ka hing hundoh asiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sidon mite, Amalek mite leh Maonmiten zong noute ahing bawl genthei ua, tuachi’n nang han ua, tuachi’n akhut ua kipat in ka hing hundoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh nouten nangle ngatsan ua, pasien dangte nna nasem zawta uhi; tuaziehin ka hing hundoh nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pei unlen na pasien deitelte uh han ve uo, amaun na buoi hun chiengun hing hundohleh asih diei,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuabepin Israel taten Mangpa kungah, “Sil kana bawlkhielta uhi. Nangman hoi nasah bangbang in ka tung uah bawl mai inlen; kang ngen uhi, tutung beeh hing hundam teitei in,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n alah ua namdang pasiente akoimang sieng ua, Mangpa nna asemta uhi. Tualeh Israelte gentheinate Alungsim Hagauin athuoh zou nawnta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ammonmite akikhawm khawm ua, Gilead ah panmun akhaw uhi. Tualeh Israel tate zong akikhawm khawm ua, Mizpah khuo ah panmun akhawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh mipite, Gilead gam lamkaite khat leh khat akihou ua, “Ammon mite dou masa dinga kuon ding koi ahiei? Gilead gam a tengte zousie tungah lamkai in apang ding” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh tuin Gilead mi Jephthah khu mihat, hangsan ahia, hinanleh ama khu kizuanu tapa ahia; tualeh Jephthah pa Gilead ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gilead zi in tapate ahin pieh a, tuachi’n azi tapate ahing khanglien ua, Jephthah khu anotdoh ua, tuachi’n akungah, “Nangpen numei tuom tapa na hi ziehin ipa innsungah gou naluo thei sih ding hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jephthah a unaute akipat in ataimang a, Tob gam ah atengta hi. Tualeh Jephthah kungah mithulimlou ngentang ateng khawm ua, ama a zuizel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahing hi a, Hun phabeppi zou in Ammon miten Israelte adouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing ahia, Ammon miten Israelte adou tahun, Gilead upate, Tob gam a um Jephthah vala ding in akuonta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh amaun Jephthah kungah, “Hing pei inlen ka gallamkai dingun hing pangin; Ammon mite kadou theina dingun,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jephthah in Gilead upate kungah, “Kei na hing muda ua, ka pa inn akipata nang nawdoh uh hilou ahiei mah? Bangchidan a tua na buoi bep chieng ua, ka kunga hing pei nahi uoi?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Gilead upaten Jephthah kungah, “Tuaziehtah ahi tu a na kunga ka hing pei kiana uh, Ammon mite dou dingin ka lah uah hing pei inlen, Gilead gam a teng mi zousie tunga vaihawma na hing pan theina dingin,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jephthahin Gilead upate kungah, “Ammon mite dou dinga inn langa nahing zawpi kia ua, tuachia Mangpa’n amauh ka khut a ahing pieh leh na tung ua vaihawm in ka pang tahtah na diei?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Gilead upaten Jephthah kungah, “Mangpa khu ikikaal thu uh theipipa hiheh, na thu bangbang in ka bawl ngeingei ding uhi,” achi ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jephthah khu Gilead upate toh azawhta a; tuachi’n mipiten atung ua vaihawm ding leh lamkai dingin ana bawlta uhi. Tualeh Jephthah in Mizpah khuo ah Mangpa mai ah thu zousie agenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n tuin Jephthah in Ammon mite leengpa kungah, “Bang dinga ka tunga bang lungdam louna nei a, ka gamsung doudinga hing kuon mawh na hiei?” chia gen dingin mi asawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Ammon mite leeng pa’n, Jephthah misawlte kungah, “Israelte Izipt gam a kipat ahing pei laiun ka gam Arnon akipat Jabbok tandong leh Jordan donga alah zieh uh ahi. Tuaziehin tuin lungkim tahin khum gamte hing nua pieh kia maiin,” chi’n ana dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh Jephthah in, Ammon mite leengpa kungah mi asawl kia a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tualeh akung ah “Tambangin Jephthahin agen hi; Israelten Moab gam alahpieh sih ua, Ammon mite gam zong alahpieh sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israelte Izipt akipat ahing pawtdoh laiun, tuipi san leh Kadesh tandong gamdai zui in ahing pei zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israelten Edom leengpa kungah, hepitahin na gamsung zui in hing pei suohsahin, chi a gen dingin palai asawl ua, hinanleh Edom leengpa’n ana phalpieh sih hi. Tualeh khumbangmain Moab leengpa kungah asawl kia a, hinanleh ama’n zong ana phalpieh kia sih hi, tuaziehin Israelte Kadesh ah aumdenta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n gamdai ah apei suoh ua, Edom gam leh Moab gam kimvel in apei kuol ua, Moab gam suolam pangah apei ua, Arnon lelam pangah giehphuol abawl ua, Moab gamsungah vang alut sih uhi. Arnon khu Moab gamgi lah ahi ngal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israelten Amor mite leengpa Heshbon a vaihawmpa Sihon kungah palai asawl kia ua, Israel taten akungah, ka mun lam ua ka peina dingun hepitahin na gam zawt in hing pei suoh sahin ava chi sah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh Sihon in Israelte khu agamsung zawta apei suoh ding uh amuongzou sih hi. Tuachi’n Sihon in amite zousie kaikhawm in Israelte dou dingin Jahaz mun ah panmun ana bawl ua, Israelte adouta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa Israelte Pasian in Sihon leh amite zousie Israelte khut ah apekheta a, tuachi’n amauh athat ua, tuachi’n Israelten khum gam a teng Amor mite gam zousie atang siengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh amaun Amormite gam zousie Arnon akipat Jabbok dong leh gamdai akipat Jordan lui tandong atangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n tuin Mangpa Israelte Pasian in ami Israelte masangah Amormite alahpieh a, nang amauh na tang ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na pasien Kemosh in na tan dinga na kunga ahing pieh khu tanglou ding na mah? Tualeh Mangpa ka Pasian un ka masang ua kipata anawdoh koipou gam khu ka tang zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh tuin, nang Moab leengpa Zippor tapa Balak sangin na hoizaw ei mah? Aman Israelte tohbuoi in adou ngam ngai amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Israelte Heshbon leh akhoneute, Aroer leh akhoneute tualeh Arnon luipanga khopi lien um zousie a kum zathum sung na teng uh hitalou ahiei mah? bang dinga khum hun sunga na nua lahlou na hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaziehin na tungah bangma ka bawlkhiel sih hi; Hinanleh nang hingdou na tup ziehin ka tungah na bawlkhiel zaw hi. Mangpa vaihawmpain tuni’n Israel tate leh Ammon mite kaal ah thukhen heh achi hi” achi sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bangtenghileh, Ammon mite leengpa’n Jephthah mi sawlte thugente ana thusim pieh sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa Hagau Jephthah tungah ahing tunga, tualeh Gilead leh Manasseh gam apalsuoh a, Gilead gam a Mizpah ah apei suoh a, tuachi’n Gilead gam Mizpah akipat in ma asawn zel a, Ammon mite gam atungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh Jephthah in Mangpa kungah “Thuchiem abawla, Ammon mite ka khut a nang pieh tah tah a ahileh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahiding hi, Ammon mite kunga kipat a galmuonga innlam zuona ka hing kile kia hun chienga, ka inn kotpi a kipata kei hing dawn dinga hing pei masa penpen Mangpa a ahi dinga, tualeh halmang kithoina’n ka lan ngeingei ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jephthah khu Ammon mite dou dingin akuon ta a, tualeh Mangpa’n amaute akhut ah apedohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tualeh Aroer apat in Minnith tandongin aguolzou zel a, khopi lien sawm ni ah gal azou a, tualeh Abel Keramim dongah thupitah in athat uhi. Tambangin Ammon mite khu Israelte masangah guollel in a umta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tualeh Jephthah khu Mizpah a atenna inn a ahing tun tahin, Ngaivawi atanu khuongta toh lam kawmin ama dawn dingin ahing pawtdoh a, ata khattang nei sun ahia, amanu chilou tanu ahiei tapa ahiei, dang mawng mawng anei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi a, amanu amutahin, apuonte abotkeh a, “Ka dei ka tanu hing suneu va-ia teichie izaw, ka buoina thupi khat na hita hi. Aziehkhu Mangpa kungah thu kana chiem khata hi, tualeh ka nualah kia thei tasih hi;” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu’n akungah, Pa “Mangpa kunga nana kichiem taahleh, na kama thupawt bangbangin ka tungah bawlmai in, Mangpa’n na galte Ammon mite tung ngei ah phuba alata hi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu’n apa kungah “Tambangin hing bawl piehin; hani sung keima tangin hing umsah inlen, taangte a ka pei a ka vah kawi theina dingin, tualeh nungah sieng thou ka hina ka suun ding hi, kei leh ka lawmte toh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama’n “Va pei in,” achi a, tuachi’n amanu hani sung tham dingin asawl kheta hi. Tuachi’n akhanguolte toh apei ua, taang tungte ah a nungah siengthou hina ava suun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi a, hani achin zou in amanu khu apa kungah ahing kile kia a, tuachi’n apa’n ana kichiemna dung zui in, amanu tungah abawlta hi. Amanu khu nungah siengthou ahia, pasal koiman alup khawmpi ngai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israelte lah ah Israel tanu ten, Gilead mi Jephthah tanu kum chinin nili sung asuun zel uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Ephraim mite akihan khawm ua, Zephon gam kantan in ang pei ua, Jephthah kungah, “Bang dinga koute hing chiellou a, Ammon mite dou dinga ka gam uh Kantan a pei na hi uoi? Na inn utoh ka hing buhal ding uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Jephthah in akung uah, “Kei leh ka miten theitawp suo a Ammon mite kadou ua ka hing thuhah laiin, akhut ua kipat nang hundoh sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n na hing hundoh nuom sih uh chi ka thei tahin, shi ki it vawtlou in ka panga, Ammon mite dou dingin ka kuon a, tuachi’n Mangpa’n amauh ka khut ah ahing peta hi, tuaziehin bangdinga ahing dou dinga hing kuon na hi uoi?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n tuin Jephthah in Gilead mi zousie ahankhawm a, Ephraimte ava douta hi, tualeh Gilead miten Ephraimte tha chitahin athat uhi, “Nou Gilead mite apat taimang Ephraimte leh Manasseh te lah a kisim tel maimai, Nam mangthang nahi uh achi zieh uh ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gilead miten Ephraim mite tun masangin Jordan lui gal kaina mun ana lata ua, “Ephraim mi daptaiten hing galkai vang” achi chiengun, Gilead miten akungah, “Ephraim mi na hiei” chi’n ana dong zel ua, “Ka hisih” achi leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Akungah “Shibboleth chi vawileh” achi ua, tualeh ama’n “Sibboleth” ana chizaw zel a, alaw chien siem thei lou ziehin aman ua, Jordan luigal kaina mun ah athat zel uhi. Tua tungin khum mun ah Ephraim mite tul sawm li leh tul ni athat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Jephthahin kumguh sung Israelte tungah vai ahawm hi. Tuachi’n Gilead mi Jephthah ashita, tualeh Gilead gam a khopi khat ah avuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh ama nua in Bethlehem khopi a um Ibzan in vai ahawm hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman tapa sawm thum anei a. Tualeh a tanu sawm thumte gamdangah pasal neiin asawl a, tualeh atapa sawmthumte a dingin, midangte tanute mou in alalut hi. Aman kum sagi sung Israelte tung ah vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ibzan ashita a, Bethlehem ah avui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh ama nua in, Zebulun mi Elon in Israelte tungah vai ahawma, tuachi’n aman Israelte tungah kumsawm sung vai ahawm hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Zebulun mi Elon ashita a, tualeh Zebulun gam a Aijalon khuo ah avuita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh ama nua in, Pirathon mi Hilel tapa Abdon in Israelte tungah vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aman tapa sawmli leh tupa sawm thum, sabiltungnou tunga tuongzel anei hi. Aman kum giet sung Israelte tungah vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pirathon mi Hilel tapa Abdon ashita a, Ephraim gam a Pirathon khuo ah Amalek mite taangah avuita uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Israel taten Mangpa mitmu in silgilou ana bawl kiata ua, tuachi’n Mangpa’n amaute Philistin mite khut ah kum sawm li sung a aum sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh Zorah khuo a um Dan inn kuon mi khat a um a, amin khu Manoah ahi, azi achiinga ta anei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa vansawlsieng numeinu kungah “Ahing kilah a, akungah ngai in, tuin na chiinga, nau navop ngai sih a ta zong nanei sih hi, hinanleh nagai dinga tapa khat nanei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaziehin, tuin pilvang inlen, uoin leh akibahpi khamthei mawngmawng dawn sinlen, tualeh sil sienglou mawngmawng zong ne sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen ngai in na gai dinga, tapa nanei ding hi, tualeh alu tungah samheuna bahte mawngmawng zah ahi sih dinga, naupang pen anu sunga a um a kipat in Pasian a dingin Nazir mi ahi dinga, aman Philistin mite khuta kipat Israelte hundamna a pan ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n numei ava pei a apasal kungah, “Pasian mi khat ka kungah ahing pei a, amel umdan khu Pasian vansawlsieng mel asun a, giin huoitah ahi, hinanleh heilanga hing kipan ahiei chi ka dong vateh sih a, aman zong amin ahing hil tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh ka kungah, ngai in nagai dinga, tapa na nei dinga, tuachi’n uoin leh akibahpi khamthei mawngmawng dawn sinlen neh sienglou sil mawngmawng zong ne vawt sin naupang pen naubu sunga aum lai a kipat in ashi dongin Pasian adinga Nazir mi ahi ding ziehin, achi hi,” chi’n ava gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Manoah in “Mangpa kungah tambangin angen ta a, Aw ka Mangpa, Pasian mi nahing sawl pen khu hepitahin ka kung uah hing peikia henlen, ahing pieng ding naupang khu bang kalaw ding uh ahiei, chi hinghil heh,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian in Manoah thunget angaikhie a, tualeh numeinu khu loulai a atou laiin akungah Pasian vansawlsieng ahing peikia a, apasal Manoah akungah aum sih hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n numeinu kintahin atai pai a, apasal avahil a, akungah “En in, khatvei nia ka kunga hing pei mipa khu ka kungah ahing kilah kia hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Manoah adingdoh a azi azui a, khum mipa kung ava tung ua, akungah, “Nang na hiei, tam numei kunga thugen pa?” achi a, Tualeh aman “Keima ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Manoah in, “Na thu bangzelin hing umta hen, naupang um dingdan bang chibang ahi diei? asep ding bang ahi diei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa vansawlsieng in Manoah kungah, “Numei kunga ka thugen zousie tungtangah pilvangta hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Grep guia kipata sil kisiemdoh mawngmawng numei nu’n aneh ding ahi sih a, uoin leh akibahpi khamthei mawngmawng adawn sih dinga, sil sienglou mawngmawng zong ane sih ding hi. Akunga thu kapieh zousie pilvang tah in vom heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n Manoah in Mangpa vansawlsieng kungah, “Hepitahin ka hing hou ding uhi, nanga dinga kelnou khat kang bawl pieh zou masang sie uh na um tadi in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa Vansawlsieng in Manoah kungah, “Hing hou nanlachin zong na ann kane sih ding, tualeh halmang sillat a nalat ding ahi leh Mangpa kunga nalat ding ahi,” achi hi. Manoah in lah Ama Mangpa vansawlsieng ahilam athei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Manoah in Mangpa vansawlsieng kungah, “Na min bang ahiei? na thugente ahing tangtun chienga ka hing pahtawi theina dingun,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa vansawlsieng in akungah, “Sillamdang munapi a, Bang dinga ka min nang doh ahiei?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Manoahin tua kelnou neh ding sillat toh ala a, suongpi tungah Mangpa kungah alan a, tualeh vansawlsieng in sillamdang tah a bawlta a, tuakhu Manoah leh azi in a enden uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hia, maitam apat meikuong vanlam a apei tou laiin, Mangpa vansawlsieng khu maitam a meikuong lah ah akaltou tahi. Tualeh Manoah leh azi in tua khu a en ua, tualeh tuol leh amai uh sutuo in apuata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachia Mangpa vansawlsieng khu Manoah leh azi kunga akilah nawnlou tahin, Manoah in Mangpa vansawlsieng ahi chi atheita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Manoah in azi kungah, “Pasian imu ziehin shi teitei ding ihi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n azi in akungah, “Mangpa’n tha hing tum hileh ikhut apat a halmang sillat leh neh ding sillat ilatte asang nuom sih dinga, tualeh tambang silte zong ahing hil sam sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n khum numei in tapa anei a, amin ding in Samson aphuo uhi. Tualeh naupang khu ahing khang lien a, Mangpa’n a guolzawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa Hagau in ama khu Zorah leh Eshtaol kikal a Mahaneh Dan mun ah ahing thahat sah panta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Samson khu Timnah khuo ah apei suh a, tualeh Timnah ah Philitia tanute lah a khat ava mu ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n ahing peitou kia in anu leh apa ahila, akung uah, “Timnah khuo ah Philistinte tanute lah a mi numei khat kava mu a, ka zi dingin hing va lah pieh un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n anu leh apan akungah, “Na unaute tanute lah ahiei ahisihleh ka chi leh namte zousie lah ah numei umlou ahiei mah, teptanlou Philistinte lah a zi ding nava sui laizang?” achi ua. Tualeh Samson in apa kungah, “Hing valah pieh mai un, amanu’n kalung atuoh mama hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh anu leh apaten khum khu Pasian a kipata hing kuon ahilam leh Philistin mite tunga hunlem asui ahilam athei sih uhi, khum hunlai in Philistin miten Israelte tungah vai ahawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samson anu leh apa toh Timnah khuo ah ahaw suh ua, Timnah khuo a grep huon ahing tung ua, tualeh ngai in humpibahnei khat in ana ngih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa hagau khu thupitahin atungah ahing tunga, tuachi’n kelnou malnen bang maiin amalnen thopa, akhut ah bangma atawi sih hi. Hinanleh asil bawl anu leh apa ahil sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh apeisuh a, khum numei toh ava houlim uhi, tualeh amanu’n Samson lung asu mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hun tomkhat nuain amanu vala ding in akuon kia a, tualeh humpibahnei luong en dingin lampam ah apiel a, tualeh ngaiin humpibahnei shiluong sung ah khuoikai leh azu ana um a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh ama’n khum khu ala a, apei kawm in ane a, tualeh anu leh apa kung ahing tuntahin, ama u’zong apie a, tuachi’n amaun zong ane uhi. Hinanleh tua khuoizu khu humpibahnei shiluong sung apat alah ahi chi ahil sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n apa numeinu kungah ava haw suh a, tualeh Samson in annkuong luina abawla, tua khu tangvalte bawldan ngaina ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hia, ama amu tahun, ama toh umkhawm dingin lawmleguol sawmthum ahing zawpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samson in akung uah, “Tuin thuhasa khat ka hing donga, pawi bawl ni sagi sunga, na theidoh thei ua, nang hilchien thei u’leh, tuachi’n puonmalngat zal sawm thum leh kihenna puon sawm thum ka hing pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh nang hilchien thei sih u’leh, puonmalngat zal sawm thum leh kihenna puon sawm thum kei na hing pieh ding uh ahi,” achi hi. “Na thu hasa hing gen vawile, na ngaikhe va ung,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh aman akung uah; “Netu akipat neh ding hing pawt, Tualeh hattah akipat sil humtah hing pawt chi khu ahi,” achi hi. Tualeh nithum sungin tua thuhasa ahilchien thei tasih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahi a, ani sagi niin Samson zi kungah, “Thuhasa ka kung ua hing hilchien dingin na pasal na zawlin, tua-ahisihleh nang leh napa innkuonte mei in ka hing haltum ding uhi. Ka sil neite uh lah pieh dinga na hing chiel ahiei mah?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samson zi’n amasangah kap kawm in, “Kei nang it sih a, ahing muda nana hi zaw hi, ka mite kungah thuhasa na donga, kei kungah lah ahilchienna bangma nagen sih a,” achi hi. Tualeh aman “Ngaiin ka nu leh ka pa zong ka hil sih hi, nang kang hil mai ding amah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n a pawi bawl uh ni sagi sungteng amai ah akap zinga, tualeh ani sagi niin hichi ahing hi a, anget nget vanguo ziehin ahil khong khongta hi, tualeh amanu’n thuhasa khu amite kungah ahilsawnta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n ni sagini nitum masangin khum khuo a miten akungah; “Khuoizu sanga hum zaw bang ahiei? Tualeh humpibahnei sanga hatzaw bang ahiei?” achi uhi. Tualeh aman akung uah, “Ka bawnglain lou kai sih ulachin, ka thuhasa theikhe zoulou ding hive uchin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa Hagau thupitahin ahing tunga, tuachi’n Ashkelon khuo ah apei suh a, mi sawmthum athat a apuon sil uh ahawh khietpieh a, thuhasa akhieh na hilchien mi sawmthumte kungah kihenna puonsil sawm thum toh apeta hi. Tuachi’n lungthah sengseng in apa inn langah apeitou ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Samson zi khu akigoppi pa, a kiten ni ua lawm a azah pa kungah pieh in a um ta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh hun tomkhat nua in, bu lah hun laiin, Samson in kelnou khat tawi in azi ava ve a; “Tualeh aman ka zi umna pindan sungah kava lut ding achi hi,” Hinanleh apa’n alut aphal tasih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh apa’n akungah, “Amanu na muda tahtah hiva ka chia; tuaziehin na lawmpa kana peta hi, anaunu ama sangin a mel hoizaw hilou ahiei mah? Hepitahin amanu taangin pui maiin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Samson in akung ah; “Tutungin Philistin mite sietna bawl nanleeng siemmaw ka tang sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samson ava kuon a, Si-al zathum ava man a, meisel ala a, si-alte amei lam chiet uh akingatuo sah a, amei u’leh amei uh ape khawma, ameite uh kikaal chiet ah meisel akoi chiet a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh meiselte mei a ahal chiet tahin si-alte khu Philistinte bu at nailou lah ah atailut sah a, buphai leh bu dinglaite leh grep huon leh Olive huonte nangawn toh akatum siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Philistinten “Koi bawl ahiei?” achi ua, tualeh amaun “Timnah khuote mahpa Samson, azi alah pieh ua alawmpa kunga apieh zieh ua abawl ahi” chiin adawng ua, tuachi’n Philistinte akipan ua, amanu leh apa meiin ahalta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Samson in akung uah, “Tambangin bawl nan ulachin zong na tung uah phuba ka la veve nalai diing hi, tuazou chiengin ka tawp ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n chin leh ha toh pang in ava dou a, mi tampi ava that hi; tuachi’n apei suh a, Etam suongpi tetuo kal hawm ah ava umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh, tuin Philistinte avakuontou ua, Juda gam ah panmun abawl ua, tualeh Lehi mun ah akijeeh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Juda miten “Bang dinga kou dou dinga hing kuon na hi uoi?” achi uhi. Tuachi’n amaun akung uah, “Samson man dinga hing kuon kahi uh, aman ang bawl bang banga, bawl dinga hing kuon ka hi uh,” chiin adawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Juda mi tul thum Etam suongpi kawmah ava pei ua, Samson kungah, “Philistinte itung ua vaihawm ahi uh chi theilou na hiei mah?” bang dinga ka tung ua “Tambanga na hingbawl ahiei?” achi ua. Tualeh aman ahing bawl bang bang ua, atung ua ka bawl ahizaw hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh amaun Philistinte kunga, “Ka hing pieh theina ding ua, nangma hing man dinga hing kuon kahi uh” achi ua. Tualeh Samson in akung uah “Nouten hing that lou dingin kichiem un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh amaun akungah “That lou e, hinanleh ka hing kaan ding ua, akhut uah ka hing pe ding uhi. Kouten ka hing that sih ding uhi,” achi uhi. Tualeh amauten khauhuol tha in akaan ua suongpi apat in a zawpi touta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khuchia Lehi mun ahing tun in, Philistinten ana kikou khum ua, Tualeh Mangpa Hagau atungah lamdang tahin ahing tunga, tuachi’n aban a akanna khauhuolte uh la ip khau mei in akahtan bangin akitan a, akhut a akaanna uh khauhuol zousie atat a akiphelkhe sieng ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Samson in sabiltung khagu tha khat amu a, akhut a zam in ala a, khumi zangin mi tul khat asat lia tahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samson in, “Sabiltung khagu in singsie suongsie in kasie vum hi;” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahia, thu agen zouin sa khagu atawi khu apaidoh a, Khum mun khu Ramath Lehi achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n adang ata mama a, tuachi’n ki kou in Mangpa ahan a, akungah “Na suohpa khutah hundamna thupitah na pie a, tualeh tuin dangta a shi ding kahi a, tuin teptanloute khuta pualut kia ding kahita amaah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pasian in Lehi mun a leihawm akhipawh sah a tuanah tui ahing pulta, tualeh khum tui adawn tahin alungsim ahing navah a, atha ahing kiham kiata a, tuaziehin khum mun min En-Hakkore achita hi. Tua khu tuni dongin Lehi ah a um nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Philistinte hun lai in Israelte tungah kum sawmni sung vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Samson Gaza khuo ah ava haw a, khunah numei kizua khat amu a, ava luppi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh “Samson tanah ahing pei hi,” chi’n Gaza khomite ava hil ua, tuachi’n a im khumta ua, khopi kul kotkha zousie ah zan tungtawn in abuh ua, “Zankhovah in asip dingdeng hi, zingmawng khuo ahing vah chiengin that navei” akichi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh Samson zankim tan alum a; tualeh zankim laiin athou a, khopi kul kotkhah leh akhuom nite abotdoh a, akilnate pum in abotdoh a, aliengkou ah apuo a, Hebron toh kimai ngat muolvum ah apotou ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khum nua in hichi ahing hi a, Sorek phai ah numei khat amin Delilah kichi nu angai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Philistin miliente amanu kungah ahing pei ua, akungah “Ama ka zaw ua, ka kantom thei ua, ka bawl gentheina dingun, ahatna hei a bangchi um ahiei, chi theina dingin na zawl in; tuachi’n mi khat in dangka tul leh zakhat chiet ka hing peding uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh Delilah in Samson kungah, “Hepitahin hing hil ve, na hatna zieh bang ahiei, heisunga bangchi um ahiei? bawl genthei dinga ahing hentom theina dingun,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Samson in amanu kungah, “Khauhuol gaw nailou zam sagi’n hing kaan u’lachin, tuachi’n hat nawn sih vangin, midangte bangin ka umta ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Philistin milienten khauhuol agaw nailou zam sagi ang tawi ua, tuachi’n amanu’n khum khauhuolte’n ana kaanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n tuin innsung tawnga pindan ah aguhin mi a um sah hi. Tuachi’n amanu’n Samson kungah “Philistin mite hing pei e, Samson” achi hi, tualeh aman tua khauhuolte khu vaukhau mei in akah tan bang giap in abottan siengta hi. Tuaziehin athahatna thuguh athei zou sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh Delilah in Samson kungah, “Ngai in, nang kei nang mot bawla, zuou nang hil hi. Hepitahin tuin hing hil in, bangchileh hentom a um thei ding na hiei,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh aman amanu kungah, “Zah ngainai mawngmawng lou khauhuolte in hing kaan u’leh ka hat nawn sih dinga, midangte ka bang mai ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin Delilah in khauhuol tha lihleh ala a, akaanta a, akungah “Philistinte hing pei uh e, Samson” achi hi. Tualeh innsung tawnga pindan sungah abuh dapte aum uhi. Tuachi’n vaukhau bawtan bang mai in akhut apat in atan siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Delilah in Samson kungah, “Tutan in nang mot bawl nalai a, zuou ngen nang hil nalai hi, kaan a na um theina ding bang ahiei hinghil in, achi hi. Tualeh aman amanu kungah “Ka sampheh lom sagi puontoh gaankhawm lachin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu’n dettahin asiem toh agatkhuma, tuhkil in dettahin akil a, Tualeh akungah “Philistinte hing pei uh e, Samson,” achi hi. Hinanleh imulai ahing thoudoh a, asiembu leh akilna pum in abotdoh siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n amanu’n akungah, “Na lungsim hing pelou pia, bangchidan a ka hing it nachi thei ahiei? Tutoh thum vei nahing motbawlta a, na hatna heia um ahiei chi nang hil nuom nai sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hita a, nichin a aphut aphut zieh leh anget vanguo ziehin, alungsim shipi ding khopin ahing buoita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n alungsim zousie ahil siengta a; akungah “Ka lu tungah sam heuna tem mawngmawng akizang ngai nai sih a; Kanu gilsunga ka um laia kipat in Pasian adinga Nazir mi ka hia; ka lutunga sam kiheu leh ka hatna in ahing nuasieta dinga, tuachi’n ka hat nawnsih dinga, midangte ka bangta ding hi;” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh alungsim zousie ahilta chi Delilah in athei bepin Philistin miliente ahan sah a, “Hing peitou pai un, alungsim zousie ahing hilta hi,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Philistin miliente akungah apeitou ua, tualeh dangka zong atawi chiet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n apheipi tungah a i mu sahta a; tualeh mikhat ahan a, alutunga sampheh lom sagite atepkhe sahta hi. Tuachi’n amanu’n abawl genthei panta a, ahatna in anuasie ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh amanu’n akungah “Philistinte hing kuon ta uh e Samson” thou in achi hi, tuachi’n a i mu lai ahing khanglou a, “Ni danga bangin, kitungdoh vangin pawtdoh naveng,” achi a, hinanleh Mangpa’n ama anuasieta chi athei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Philistin miten aman ua, amittang akheikhie ua, tualeh Gaza khopi ah azawpi suhta ua, sum-eng kol abun sah ua, suongkul sungah bu heh in a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh alu tunga asam kiheute ahing pou pan pan kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh tuin Philistin miliente a pasien uh Dagon kunga kithoina lan ding leh guolnop thupitah bawl dingin ahing kikhawm ua, tuachi’n amaun “I pasien un igalpa Samson ikhut sungah ahing pekheta,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mipiten ama amu tahun apasien uh aphat ua; “I pasien un igalpa leh igam, hing suh siet piehpa, mitampi tah hing thatpa i khut sung uah ahing pedohta hi,” a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahing hia, alungsim uh ahing kipah mama tah in, etnop bawl dingin “Samson va hansah un” achi uhi. Tuachi’n suongkul apat in Samson ava hankhie ua; tualeh etnop a bawl in, khuom ni kikaal ah akoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tualeh Samson in ama kai naupangpa kung ah, “Tam inn doupen khuom nite hing tham sah in, ka kingap theina dingin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua biehinn sungah numei pasal leh Philistin miliente zousie adim phing phengin a um ua, tualeh Samson etnop banga en mite inntung langah numei leh pasal tul thum tah a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh, Samson in Mangpa ahan a, “Aw Mangpa Pasian, hepitahin hing thei ngitnget inlen, tutung mai mai hing suhat inlen, Aw Pasian, ka mit langni phuba Philistin mite tunga khatvei thu a kalah theina dingin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh, Samson in khum inn doupen sutpi nite athama, a khut ziet lam in khat apansan a, aveilamin khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh Samson in “Philistin mite toh hing shi khawm sah in,” achi a, tualeh atheitawp a pangin asawn tuoh a, tuachi’n tua inn khu miliente leh khuna um mi zousie toh achim khawmta hi. Tuachi’n adam lai a athate sangin, ashi khumte atam zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n, a unaute leh apa innkuonpite zousie ahing pei suh ua, aluong ava la ua, apotou ua, Zorah leh Eshkol kikaal a apa Manoah kivuina ah avuita uhi. Aman kum sawmni sung Israelte tung ah vai ahawm hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh Ephraim singtang gam ah mi khat aum a, amin Mikah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman anu kungah “Dangka tul khat leh za khat, na kunga pat a kilamang, tungtang a awsie na law khu kabil mama in kaza hi, khum dangka ka kungah aum hi, keima lah ahi,” achi hi. Tualeh “Mangpa’n hing guolzawl heh, ka tapa” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n dangka tul leh zakhat anu kungah apekia a, tualeh anu’n “Tam dangka keima khut mama in ka tapa sum tuom ding leh amilim khenna ding leh milim a asun dingin Mangpa kungah ka lan hi, tuaziehin tuin nangma kungah ka hing pe kia hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khum dangka khu anu kungah apeta a, tuachi’n anu’n dangka zani ala a, dangka kheng mi kungah apie a, tuachi’n aman milim dingin akhenga, milim dingin ana sungta hi: tua khu Mikahinn ah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua mipa Mikah in pasiente biehna inn khat anei a, ephod leh teraphim abawla, atapa khat aseptuoma, ama khu siempu ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khum hunlai in Israel gam ah leeng ana um nai sih a, michin ama uh hoisah dan danin agamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh Juda gam a Bethlehem khuo ah, Juda phung sunga um; Levi tangval khuol zin mikhat a um a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua mipa khu umna ding mun suiin Bethlehem Juda khuo a pat in apawtdoh a; khuchia avah kawi kawi nalam ah Ephraim singtang gam a Mikah inn ava tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh Mikah in akungah, “Hei a hing kipan na hiei?” achi hi. Tualeh aman akungah, “Bethlehem-Juda mi, Levi nam a mi ka hia, umna ding sui a vah kawi kawi kahi” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mikah in akungah, “Ka kungah um inlen, kei dingin ka pa leh siempuin pang inlen, kum chinin dangka sia tang shekel sawm hing pe vangin, puon sil khat leh neh leh taah dingte zong,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Levi mipa alutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Levi mipa’n khum mipa kunga um lem asata a; tuachi’n tangval pa zong atapate lah a khat bangin a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Mikah in Levi mipa khu atuom in akoi tuomta a. Tualeh tangvalpa khu a siempuin apangta a, tuachi’n Mikah inn ah a umta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mikah in, “Tuin Levimi siempuin ka neita a, Mangpa’n ahing lamzang sah ngeingei ta ding chi ka thei hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum hunlai in Israel gam ah Leng a um sih a; tualeh, khum hunlai in Dan namten gam luo ding asui ua; tualeh khum hunlai in Israel namte lah ah gam luo ding atang nai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Dan miten agam ua kipat in anam pumpi sung ua mi nga, pasal hat leh hangsan, Zorah leh Eshtaol akipat in gam enkhe ding leh sui dingin asawl ua; akung uah, “Vakuon unlen gam va enkhie un” achi ua; tuachi’n amauh Ephraim singtang gam a Mikah inn ava tung ua, agiehta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mikah inn a aum laiun, Levi mi tangvalpa aw aza ua, akihei ua, akungah “Tam laitah a koi hing zawpi na hiei? Tanah bang bawl na hiei? Tam mun a bangchi ten a, bang ahiei na bawl?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman akung uah, “Mikah in tambangin ahing bawla, asiempu dingin ahing guoi a, tuachi’n kana pangta hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khumin, ama un akungah, “Kava hawna ding uah ka lam zanna ding uoi chi ka thei thei na dingun hepitahin Pasian hing doh pieh dive,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh siempu’n akung uah, “Lungmuong tah in peiun; na peina ding lampi uah Mangpa’n a hing umpi zel ahi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuabepin pasal ngaten, khum mun pawtsan in, apeita ua Laish ava tungta uhi. Tualeh khuna um mite pen Sidon mite mabanga bangma phawhlou a, lungmuong tah leh bittah a um ava mu ua; khum gam ah bang thu ahiei amauh a zumsuo ding thukhen leh vaihawm a um sih a, Sidon mite akipat gamlapi a kihal ahi ua, tualeh koima toh kizopna mawngmawng anei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Zorah leh Eshtaol a aunaute uh kung ahing nua tun kia tah un, aunaute un “Bang thu na hing tun uoi?” chi’n ana dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun akung uah, “Kisa un vakuon tou vaiin vadou vaui, khum gam kava mu ua, tualeh gam hoi mama ahi. Nouten bangma bawl sawmlou nahi uh amah? khum gam a valut a valuo dingin kiheh sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nava pei chiengun galmuonga um mite leh agam letdan nava mu ding uhi. Tua gam khu Pasian in na khut ua ahing piehsa ahita hi. Leitunga sil um bangma tahsap mawngmawng umlouna mun ahi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh Dan namte, Zorah leh Eshtaol akipat in, kidouna galvan kengin mi za guh akuonkheta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n akuontou ua, Juda gam a Kiriath-Jearim ah panmun akhaw ua, tuaziehin khum mun khu tuni dongin Mahaneh-Dan achita uhi. (Kiriath Jearim tum lam panga um ahi)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khuna kipat in Ephraim singtang gam lang azuon ua, Mikah inn ava tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Laish gam enkhe dinga kuon mi ngaten a unaute u’kungah, “Tami inn sungah, Ephod leh milimte, milim khenthute, milim sunthawte, aum chi na thei uoi? tuaziehin tuin bang ahiei na bawl ding uh, ngaituo un,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama uh khuna kipat in akihei ua, Levi mi tangvalpa umna Mikah inn ah apei ua, bang na chi zel ei ava chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Dan mite kidouna galvan tawi mi za guhte, khopi kul kotpi lutna ah ading uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh gam enkhe dinga kuon mi ngate, apeitou ua, tuachi’n ava lut ua, milim kikhengte, Ephod leh milim kisiemthute ava la ua; tualeh siempupa khu kulkotpi lutna ah galvan tawimi zaguh toh ading khawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh khum mite Mikah inn ah ava lut ua, milim kikhengte, Ephod leh milim kisungte ava la ua, tuachi’n siempuin “Bang ahiei na bawl uh?” achi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh ama un akungah, “Haam Sin, na khutin na kam hum inlen, tualeh ka kung uah hing pei inlen kou a dingin pa leh siempu’n hing pangin, nanga dingin innkuon khat giap siempu apan ahoizaw amah? ahisihleh nam khat leh Israel innkuon khat siempu apan?” achi ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua siempupa lungtang akipahta a, tualeh Ephod, milimte leh milim kisungte ala a, mite lah ah apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n akihei ua, anaupang neute uh, aganhonte u’leh, avante uh masuon in apeisanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Mikah inn akipat gamla simtah aphah tahun Mikah inn kim nai a umte akikhawm ua, anuadel ua, anua phahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh Dan mite anuahat ua, tualeh amauh akinua hei ua, Mikah kungah “Bang pen in na lungsim hing subuoi a mi hizapi na khop khawm ahiei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tualeh aman akung uah, “Ka pasiente keiman ka kibawlte leh siempu zawpi in na kipeimangpi mawh ua, tuin bang ka nei nalai ei? Bangchidan a bangin hing subuoi ahiei? hing chi nalai nahi uoi?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Dan miten akungah, “Ka lah uah mawh ham sin, mi lungtom khat khut na thuoh kha dinga, na innkuonpite toh na hinna uh nataan kha ding uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n Dan mite akipeita ua, tualeh Mikahin ama sang a hatzaw leh dou guollou ahi uh chi a mu ziehin, a inn langah akinuale kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mikah in abawl silte leh asiempupa apeipi ua, Laish khuo a gal muonga um khinkhiante kung ava tung ua, namsau in aban satlia ua, khopi mei in ahal tumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Sidon akipata agamlat seng ziehin, ahunkhe ding koima aum sih hi, tualeh koima toh kizopna anei sih uhi. Tualeh tami Beth Rehob phaijang kung a um ahi. Tuachi’n khopi khu asiempha ua, khunah atengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh amauten tua khopi apu uh Israel suon Dan min lain Dan achita uhi, hinanleh amin masa Laish akichi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh Dan taten milim bawlthu atung dingta ua, tualeh Mosi tupa, Gershom tapa Jonathan leh atapate, tua gam mite sal a puimang ahi masangsie uh Dan namte siempu in apang denta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mikahin abawlthu milim, khu Shiloh khuo a Pasian inn a aum sungteng in ading sahta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh khum hunlai in hichi ahi a, Israel gam a leeng aumlou lai in, Levi nam mikhat Ephraim singtang gam tawplam ah aum a, Juda gam a Bethlehem numei khat mei dingin anei hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hinanleh ameinu’n ang akawmsana, tuachi’n Bethlehem-Juda gam a apa inn ah apeisan a, khunah hali tah ava um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n apasal akipan doh a, asuohpa leh sabil tung ni azawpi a, kamdam a houpi a puikia tumin ava nuadel a, tuachi’n amanu’n apa inn ah ana pui lut a, tualeh nungahnu pa’n tuami ana muin akipahpi mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh asungpa, nungahnu pain ahouta a, tuachi’n nithum sung akungah ataam sah a, tuachi’n ane ua adawn ua, khunah agiehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh ani li niin hichi ahing hia, zingmawng matahin athou a, apei dingin akisa a, tualeh nungahnu pain amahpa kungah, “Tanghou them khat beh ne inlen na lungtang suhal tadi inlen tuazou chiengin na pei nasih diei mah,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n atou ua ane in adawn khawm ua, tualeh nungahnu pain tua mipa kungah, “Hepitahin tuzan gieh nalai mai inlen lungmuong tahin umin achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh tua mipa pei dinga kisa in adingdoh a, hinanleh asungpa’n azawl zawla, tuabepin agieh kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n ninga achinni zingmawng matahin athou a pei dingin akisa a, hinanleh nungahnu pa’n “Hepitahin na lungsim halsah tadi lachin asih diei,” achi hi, tuachi’n nitahlam nikai tan akhawl khawm ua ann ane khawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tualeh tua mipa khu ameinu leh a suohpa toh pei dinga akisah leh, asungpa, nungahnu pa’n akungah “En in, ni zong akaita a, nitah lam ahita hi; tuzan giehkia tadi mawngmawng un, en ve, khuo zong miel pai ding ahita hi; hepitahin kisuhal inlen, lung nuom tahin um un, tuachi’n zing chiengin, zingmawng matahin na thou dinga, na peibai nasih diei” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh tua mipi khu khum zan agieh ut nawn sih a, adingdoh a, apeita hi. Tualeh Jebus khogal ahing tunga, (tua khu Jerusalem ahi) Sabiltung siemsa ni leh ameinu toh ahi uhi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jebus kho gei ahing tun in, ni a ngiem mama ta a; tualeh a suohpa’n apu kungah, “Hepitah in hing peiin, tam Jebus mite khopi ah lut vaiin, igieh mai ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh apu in akungah, “Israel mi hilou, nam dang khuo ah lut ngal lou e, Gibeah khuo lam izuon zaw ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh aman, asuohpa kungah, “Hing pei inlen, Gibeah khuo ahiei, Ramah khuo ahiei anai penpen ah gieh zaw mai vai,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh apei suoh ua, Gibeah kho gei atun un, ni atumta hi, tua khu Benjamin mite tenna khuo ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Gibeah khuo a gieh dingin alutta ua, kholai lamthuom khat ah atouta hi, tuachi’n koima khat in zong ka inn ah tuzan hing gieh in achi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khum hun laitahin Puteh aloukuonna apat ahing vaitunga, amapa zong Ephraim singtang gam a nateng ngaimi ahia; Gibeah khuo a na tungtha pan ahi, khum khomite pen Benjamin mite ngen ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh tehsepu kihei a a dahdoh leh kholai a tou zinte amu a; “Heisunga hing kipan a, Hei a haw ding na hi uoi?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama’n akungah, “Bethlehem-Juda gam a kipan a Ephraim singtang gam tawp a peitum kahi, khum gam a teng ka hia, Juda gam Bethlehem a vahaw ka hi; tuin Mangpa inn a haw sawm ka hia, hinanleh koima ahing zintun nuom a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka Sabiltungte ua dingin bupawl leh gan ann ka nei ua, kei leh na suohnu ading tualeh na suohpa tangval a dingin tanghou leh uoin a um hi, bangma tahsap ka nei sih uhi;” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh tehse, pu’n, “Hamuong tahin um un, na tahsap zousie uh keiman tuoh navang kholai ah vang gieh damai un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n ainnsungah a puilut a, tualeh asabiltungte gan ann apie a, tualeh akengte uh asil ua, ane un a dawnta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuabanga lung muongleh nuomtah a, a um lai un thakhat in khum khuo a mi Belial tapate pawl khat in a umna inn uh ahing imta ua, kot avasu ua, tualeh innneipa tehsepu kungah, “Na inn sunga hing lutpa ka pawl theina dingun hing pawt sahin,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuachi’n inn neipa ava pawtdoh a, akung uah, “Hilou e, Hilou e, ka unaute! hichi talawm in silgilou bawl sih un! tam mipa ka inn a hing tung ahi chi nathei ua, hepitahin tambang sil mothuoi bawl mawngmawng sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />En un tanah ka tanu nungah siengthou khat leh amapa meinu a um a, ama-utegel hing puidoh vang in, zala sah unlen, hoinasah bang bangun atung uah bawl un, hinanleh tam mipa tungah tambang sil mothuoi bawl sih un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hinanleh khum miten athugen asang nuom sih ua, tuachi’n tua mipa’n ameinu aman a amaute ava peta hi, tualeh amaun ana luppi ua, zan tungtawn in aluppi ua, asumel sie ua, tualeh khovah kuonin apei sahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n tua numei nu khu khovah tahin ahing pei a, apasal tunna tehsepu inn kot bul ah, apuata-a, khovah dongin aumdenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh zingmawng in apasal athoua, peidia kisa a, kot ahing honleh, En in, ameinu kotphungah ana pua a, akhutte kotlam zungah ana zam a, tuakhu apasal in amuta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman akungah “Thouta in peita vai,” achi a, hinanleh adawngta sih hi. Tuachi’n tua mipa’n amanu khu sabiltung tungah akhangdoh a, tuachi’n akipan a aumna munlam zuonin apeita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tualeh ainn a atuntahin, temta ala a, ameinu aman a, agute toh amanu tahsa se sawm leh seni asuo a, tua khu Israelte tenna gam zousie ah, athot suohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh hichi ahing hi a, amu kha tapouin, “Israel tate Izipt gam a kipat a ahing pawtdoh nua un, tunitan in, tambanga sil kibawl mawng mawng a um ngainai sih a, mu zong aki mungainai sih hi, ngaituo unlen, kihou unlen genvawi un” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel tate zousie ahing kithing doh ua, thukhat satin, Dan akipat Beersheba tandongin, Gilead gam akipat a mipi zousie mihing khat bangmai in. Mizpah a Mangpa kungah akikhawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh mipi Lamkai zousiete leh Israel nam zousie Pasian mipite kikhop khawmna ah ava pang chiet uhi, pasal namsau tawi thei galkap tul zali ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Banjamin miten, Israeltate Mizpah khuo ah akuontou uh chi ana zata ua. Tuachi’n Israel taten, “Bangchidan a tambanga gitlouna hing piengdoh ahiei?” hing hil un achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n, tha a um khum numeinu pasal Levi mipa’n, “Benjamin namte tenna Gibeah khopi ah ka meinu toh gieh dingin kava lut ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Gibeah miten ahing bulu ua, kei ziehin ka tunna in zanlai in ahing imtawm ua, tha ahing tum ua, ka meinu aluppi ua, asuol lia ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n, ka meinu luong ka sem nen a Israelte tenna gam tenga ka hing hawm zah ahi; Israel gam ah sil kidahhuoi leh mot huoi tah ana bawlta mawh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nou Israel tate zousie aw, Ngaiun, tuin tam mun ah na ngaidan u’leh hoi nasah dan uh genvawi un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipite zousie lungkhat puoin, adingdoh duom ua, “Koima ipuon innte ah peivawt sih va ui, koima i inn lang uah inua peisih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gibeate ibawl ding dan, hichibang ahi ding hi, ai isaan ding ua, adou dingin ikuontou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gibeah muna Benjamin mite iva dou chieng ua, neh ding ann pedingin, Israel nam zousie apat in, mi zakhat ah sawm, tul khat ah zakhat, tul sawmah tul khat, zel itel doh ding ua; Benjamin miten Gibeah a, Israel gamsunga sildihlou abawl uh dungzui ua, athuh theina ding un,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel mi zousie, mikhat bang mai a kithutuohin akikhawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel namten Banjamin nam zousiete kungah, “Na lah ua hichibang gitlouna hing umta mawh khu bangchidan ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gibeah khuo a Belial tate hing pedoh unlen, tuachi’n ka that ding ua, Israelte lah a kipat in gitlouna ka hemmang ding uhi,” chiin agen sah uhi. Hinanleh Benjamin suonten a unaute uh, Israel suonte thugente a ngaisah shi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khuchinahsangin, Benjamin tate khu Israel namte dou ding in akhopite ua kipat in ahing kuonkhie ua, Gibeah ah akikhawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh khum hunlai in Benjamin mite khopite a kipat a namsau tawia pawtdohte khu, Gibeah khuo a mi hangsan kiteldoh tuom za sagite simlou, in tul sawmni leh tul guh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua mite zousie lah ah tel tuom za sagi ahi ua, abawn un veilawng ngen ahi uhi. Tualeh a unpi un saili kap siem chiet ahi ua, samzang chie zong khiel ngailou chiet ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh Benjaminte simlou in, Israel mite namsau tawi mi ngen tul zali ahi ua, abawn un galdou dan siem ngentang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh Israel tate adingdoh ua, Bethel a Pasian inn ah apeitou ua, tualeh Pasian ava dong ua, “Benjamin mite dou dingin ka lah uah koi ahiei kuon masa pen ding?” achi ua; Tualeh Mangpa’n “Juda kuontou masa heh” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel tate khu zingmawng in athou ua, Gibeah dou dingin Gibeah khuo a imta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh Israel mite Benjamin namte dou dingin akuondoh ua, Tuachi’n Israel tate amauh dou dingin Gibeah khuo ah pan mun akhaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuachi’n Benjamin mite Gibeah akipat in ahing kuon ua, tuami niin Israel tate tul sawmni leh tul ni ahing that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh Israel mipite khat leh khat akihantawh ua amasanga apanna mama uah pan mun asiem kia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh Israel tate akuontou ua, Mangpa mai ah nitahlam tandong ava kap ua. “Ka unau uh Benjamin namte dou dingin ka kuon kia nading uoi?” chi’n Mangpa adong ua, tuachi’n Mangpa’n “Vakuon kia un,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel taten ani ni ni’n Benjamin tate dou dingin akuontou kia ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tualeh Benjaminte zong amauh dou dingin Gibeah apat in ani ni niin Gibeah akipat in apawtdoh ua, tualeh Israel tate mi tul sawm leh tul giet ava that ua, tamite zousie namsau tawi ngentang ahi uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel tate zousie Bethela a Pasian inn uah ava pei ua, ava tou ua, nitah dongin ann ngawl in ava kap ua, tualeh Mangpa mai ah halmang sillat leh lemna sillat ava lan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tualeh Israel taten Mangpa kungah, thu adong ua. (Khum hunlai in Pasian thuhun bawm khu khunah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh Aaron tapa Eleazar, Eleazar tapa Phinehas khum hun lai in amasangah a ding hi.) “Ka unaupa Benjamin dou dingin ka kuon kia diei? Ahisihleh ka tawpsan mai diei?” achi a. Tualeh Mangpa’n “Kuon tou in zingchiengin na khut ah ka hingpe ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuachi’n, Israel miten Gibeah khopi kim ah aguh a buhdap ding mi akoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tualeh anithum niin Israel tate Benjamin namte dou dingin akuontou ua, amasanga bangin Gibeah dou dingin pan mun asiem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuachi’n Benjamin namte zong mite dou dingin akuontou ua, tualeh khopi apat in apawtdoh ua, amasa a bangin mite dou in athat pan kiata ua, lamliente ah, Bethela Pasian inn zotna lampite ah, tualeh Gibeah zotna lam liente ah Israel mi sawm thum vel athat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tualeh Benjamin miten “Amasa mabangin imasang ah zala kia ta uh e,” achi ua. Hinanleh “Israel tate’n itai ding ua khopi akipat lamlien langah kihemkhe suh vai ui e,” akichi ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />tuachi’n Israel mi zousie’n apan mun uh apawt san ua, Baal tamar mun ah panmun abawl ua, tualeh Israel mite aguh a na buhdapte zong Gibeah tumlam apat in ahing pawtkhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tualeh Israelte zousie lah a teltuom ngentang tul sawmten Gibeah khuo ava bulu ua, akidou uh athupi mama hi. Hinanleh Benjaminten atung ua vangsietna hing tung ding ahilam athei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n Benjamin namte Israelte masangah aguollel sahta hi; Tualeh khum ni’n Israel taten Benjamin namte tul sawmni leh tul nga leh zakhat athat ua, tuate khu abawn un namsau tawi ngen ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuachi’n Benjamin namten aguollelta uh chi ahing kitheita ua, Israel taten Gibeah khuo dou dinga aguh a tangpanga akoite uh amuon zou zieh un, Benjamin namte akinuakhin san zawta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tualeh aguh a tangpangten Gibeah khuo thakhat in abulu ua, tuachi’n aguh a tangpangte akikhenjah ua, khosunga mi um zousie namsau in asatlia siengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Israel tate leh aguh a tangpangte akithei tuona ding ua chiemtena aguot uh ahileh khopi sunga meikhu van lang a meilum banga zamsah tou vevaw ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Israelte galdou banou khat akhawl tahdi kal un, Benjamin namte akipan ua, Israel mi sawm thum athat ua, “I kidou chilni mabangin imasang uah guollel kia ding ahita uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hinanleh khopi sunga meikhu meilum banga ahing kituntou ngei ngui tahin, Benjamin mite kihei a anua et u’leh, ngai in, khopi pumpi vanlam ah meikhu in azamtouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tualeh Israelte ahing kinuale kia tah un, Benjaminte abuoiseta ua, tansie atung ua tung ahi chi atheita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuaziehin Israelte masangah, kinua heiin gamdai lang manawin ataijahta uhi, hinanleh kidouna in alapman a, tuachi’n khopi a kipat a hing pawtten ana thatta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Benjaminte a im khum ua, anuadel ua, Gibeah suolam gal dongin that kawm kawm in adelphata uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Khunah Benjamin mi tul sawm leh tul giet athat ua, amaute pasal hat leh hangsan ngen ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuachi’n akilehei ua, gamdai a Rimmon suongpi lang ah ataijahta uhi, tualeh Israel taten mi tul nga lamlien dungah asatlia uhi, tualeh Gidom tandong Benjamin mite anuadel peh ua, alah ua mi tul ni athat nalai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuachi’n khum ni a Benjamin mi ki thatte zousie tul sawmni leh nga ahia, aunpi un namsau tawi thei chiet ahi ua, mihat leh hangsan ngen ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hinanleh mi zaguhte pen gamdai a Rimmon suongpi langah ataizah ua, tualeh amaute Rimmon suongpi ah hali sung ava um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tualeh Israel mite, Benjaminte dou dingin akipan pha kia ua, khopi sunga um zousie mihing hiin ganta hileh amu zousie uh namsau hiem in asat lia zel uhi. Tualeh khopi aphah khahna pouma u’zong mei in ahaltum zel uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Tuin Israel miten Mizpah khuo ah, “I lah ua mi koima’n itanute uh, Benjamin mite zi dingin ipe mawngmawng sih ding uh,” chi’n akichiemta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipite Bethel a Pasian inn ah ahaw ua, nitah dongin amasangah atou ua, aw ngaitah a kikou in, hasetahin akapta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama un “Aw Mangpa, Israelte Pasian, bangchidan a Israelte lah a tambang sil hing um ahiei? tunia Israelte nam khat a samta maiding adiei?” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n azingni’n hichi ahi a, zingmawng matah in mite ahing thou ua, maitam abawl ua, tuanah halmang sillat leh lemna sillatte alan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel taten, “Israel nam pumpi kikhopna a, Mangpa masanga khawmpi a hing panglou koi a um ei?” achi ua. Mizpah khuo a “Mangpa masanga hawlou pouma thalup ahi ding” chiin kichiemna thupi tah ana neita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel tate khu aunaupa uh Benjamin ziehin alungdong mama ta uhi. “Tuni’n Israelte lah ah nam khat sat khieh ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bang ilawta ding uoi leh? adam sunte zi dingin itanute koiman pelou dingin Mangpa mai ah ina kichiemta ngal ua,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh amaun “Israel namte lah a, Mizpah khuo a Mangpa mai a, hing pang khalou koi nam pen ahiei?” achi ua. Tualeh ngaiin kikhopna ah Jabesh-Gilead mite koima khat zong ahawsih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mipite akisim u’leh Ngaiin Jebesh Gilead mite khat zong ana umta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipi kikhawmten mihat leh hangsan ngen mi tul sawm leh tul ni asawl ua, “Kuon unlen, Jebesh-Gilead a teng zousie, numei leh naupang pum in namsau in va satlia siengun, chiin thu apie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na bawl ding dan uh tambang ahi ding hi, pasal kichi pouma na that ding ua, tualeh numei pasal toh lumkhawmsa pouma zong na that gam ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua Jabesh-Gilead a tengte lah ah, nungah siengthou pasal toh kipawl kha nai vawtlou zali amu ua, tualeh amaute Kanaan gam a um Shiloh giehphuol ah ahing zawpita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipi kikhawm zousieten Rimmon suongpi aum, Benjamin mite kungah mi lawi khat lemna thu gen dingin asawl ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n, Khumi tungin Benjamin te ahing nua pei ua, tualeh, Jabesh Gilead numei ahing puite uh azi dingun apie ua, hinanleh atangkim zounai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mangpa’n Israel namte lah a, suhgemna abawltah ziehin mipite Benjaminte ziehin alungdong mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n mipi kikhawm upate’n “Benjamin numeite lah ithat gamta uh chi ithei ngal ua, ahingsun pasalte zi ding bang ichi ngaituo piehding uh ata diei?” akichi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh amaun “Israelte lah a nam khat suhmanga a umlou na dingun, Benjamin nam um sunten hahle suon bangchin inei sah thei ding uoi? akichi ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Itanute u’lah azi dingun ipe thei tasih ua,” aziehpen Israel tate koipou in “Benjaminte toh atanu kitengsah pen pen gausap in um heh” chi’n, ina kichiemta uhi achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun, “Ngaivawi, Bethel mallang, Bethel akipat Shekem zottouna lamlien suolam a Lebanon simlang a um Shiloh khuo ah kum chin in, Mangpa adinga ann zaluina a um zel hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaziehin amaun Benjamin tate thu apie ua, “Pei unlen grep huon lah ah na buhdap unlen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh na ngah unlen, Shiloh nungahte lamphuola lam dinga ahing pawtdoh chiengun, grep huonna pat hing pawtdoh unlen, michin in Shiloh nungahte na zi dingun, khat chiet na kimat unlen, Benjamin gam lam ah peipi ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n hichi ahi dinga, apate uh ahiei, ahisihleh asanggam pasalte uh ahiei, tam thu gen dinga, ka kung ua, ahing pei chiengun, kouman akung uah, koute zal in nahepi un, kidouna alah azi ding uh, ikhawi pieh sih ua, nouten lah tutan in azi ding uh nana pe tuom sih ua, napie hita ulachin zong na kichiemnate zieh un; na lung sim uah kisiem tansih va uchin, kana chi mai ding uhi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tualeh Benjamin miten tuabangin abawlta ua, tuabanga nungahte ahing lamtah un, mi khat in azi ding uh nungah khat chiet aman ua, tuachi’n azi ding un a peipita uhi, tuachi’n agam luona uah anua pei kia ua, khopite asiemtha ua, khunah atengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuachi’n Israel tate khum hun in, tua mun akipat in akikhen ua, michin ama ama namte lah leh a innkuonpite lah ah tualeh ama uh mun chiet ah apeita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khum hunlai in Israel gam ah leeng a um sih a, michin amauh hoisah dan bang chiet in akigamtat uhi.
  </para>
</usx>
